itute for Gentle Improvement. We have been expecting you, in a very relaxed way.',\n  'A new morning. The island has prepared absolutely no urgent emails.',\n  'The sea is calm. Dennis is less calm, but is working on it.',\n  'You have made space for yourself. The advanced mats have made space for you.',\n  'It is the Gentle Games! Participation is mandatory only for the gulls.'\n];\n\nconst CAST = [\n  ['Gertrude', 'I used to be competitive. Now I am competitively relaxed.'],\n  ['Dennis', 'I brought a towel in case of a personal breakthrough.'],\n  ['Marisol', 'A wobble is just your body writing in cursive.'],\n  ['Young Kevin', 'I am called Young Kevin because the other Kevin has tenure.']\n];\n\nconst COLORS = ['#d98a68', '#e8b28d', '#8c573f', '#f1ccad', '#b87956', '#704638'];\nconst OUTFITS = ['#e98d78', '#79b9ac', '#e7b961', '#9b9dd1', '#638ca5', '#d77f9c'];\nconst clamp = (number, min, max) => Math.max(min, Math.min(max, number));\nconst escapeHTML = value => String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, character => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '\"': '&quot;', \"'\": '&#39;' })[character]);\n\nfunction seeded(seed) {\n  let state = seed >>> 0 || 1;\n  return () => { state ^= state << 13; state ^= state >>> 17; state ^= state << 5; return (state >>> 0) / 4294967296; };\n}\n:root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#263d42;--muted:#708485;--teal:#248e8b;--line:#d9e9e2;--paper:#fffefa;--sun:#f8cc76;--shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(41,78,72,.12)}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden}body{font-family:ui-rounded,\"Avenir Next\",Avenir,\"Trebuchet MS\",sans-serif;background:#e9f4ed;color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoo\nthing:antialiased}button,input,select{font:inherit}button{color:inherit;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:4px solid #f3bb5d;outline-offset:3px}#world{position:\nfixed;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}#app{position:fixed;inset:0;overflow:auto;scrollbar-width:thin}#app:empty{pointer-events:none}.page{min-height:100%;padding:clamp(20px,4vw,64px);display:flex;f\nlex-direction:column;position:relative}.topbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;z-index:2}.brand{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:cla\nmp(10px,.9vw,13px);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.brand-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--teal);color:white;border-radius:50%;width:30px;height:30px;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:\n0}.top-actions{display:flex;gap:8px}.icon-btn,.small-btn{border:1px solid rgba(72,116,105,.18);background:rgba(255,255,250,.83);border-radius:999px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(42,72,64,.05);font-weight:800;paddi\nng:11px 17px}.icon-btn:hover,.small-btn:hover{background:#fff;transform:translateY(-2px)}.hero{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:0}.hero-copy{width:min(50%,620px);padding:28px 0 54px}.eyebrow{fo\nnt-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.19em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b9186}.eyebrow:before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:25px;height:2px;background:#8fb9a5;vertical-align:middle;margin-rig\nht:10px}.logo{font-size:clamp(50px,7.5vw,108px);letter-spacing:-.075em;line-height:.88;margin:20px 0 22px;font-weight:900;color:#244944}.logo span{color:#49a99d}.lede{font-size:clamp(17px,1.6vw,23px);line-heigh\nt:1.45;max-width:470px;color:#58716e;margin:0 0 28px}.menu-stack{display:grid;gap:10px;width:min(100%,370px)}.action{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;text-align:left;border\n:1px solid rgba(61,119,103,.11);background:rgba(255,255,250,.92);border-radius:18px;padding:16px 19px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(50,95,80,.06);font-weight:850;font-size:17px;transition:transform .15s,box-shadow\n .15s,background .15s}.action:hover,.action.is-focused{transform:translateX(6px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(46,112,98,.15);background:#fff}.action.primary{background:#2b9991;color:white;border-color:#2b9