{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_110","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; ls -la; printf '\\\\n--- source files ---\\\\n'; ls -lh \\\"\"'$D\"/src \"$D\"/vendor | head -35; printf '\"'\\\\n--- progress ---\\\\n'; cat PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- hub client surface ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'function (time|connect|ready|card)|\\\\b(time|connect|ready|card|result|progress|probe)[:( ]' \\\"\"'$D/vendor/session.js\" | head -60; printf '\"'\\\\n--- current UI selectors ---\\\\n'; rg -o '\\\\.balance-plate|\\\\.plate-ring|\\\\.plate-dot' \\\"\"'$D/src/style.css\" | sort -u'","aggregated_output":"total 96\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha  4096 Nov  4 22:17 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 micha micha  4096 Nov  4 22:13 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 65097 Nov  4 22:13 PLAN.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha   939 Nov  4 22:25 PROGRESS.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 12501 Nov  4 22:13 TASK.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 7 micha micha  4096 Nov  4 22:25 Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356\n\n--- source files ---\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/src:\ntotal 80K\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 8.7K Nov  4 22:35 art.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 4.9K Nov  4 22:25 data.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  45K Nov  4 22:42 game.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 9.8K Nov  4 22:29 style.css\n\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/vendor:\ntotal 252K\ndrwxr-xr-x 4 micha micha 4.0K Nov  4 22:18 clipsrc\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 173K Nov  4 22:18 fitclips.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  20K Nov  4 22:18 mocap.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  29K Nov  4 22:18 readable.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  17K Nov  4 22:18 session.js\n\n--- progress ---\n# Progress\n\n## Handoff\n- Game title: Wee Bit of Zen\n- Deliverable basename: `Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356`\n- Build a complete, single-file game from `PLAN.md` and follow `TASK.md` for the handoff.\n\n## Status\n- [x] Read the task and begin extracting the game design.\n- [x] Fetch the required engine, mocap clips, and AI Hub client and harness.\n- [ ] Integrate the engine and AI Hub.\n- [ ] Implement the island, activities, story, saves, settings, and accessibility.\n- [ ] Build the self-contained HTML and structured exit interview.\n- [ ] Exercise the game and inspect responsive, cross-browser screenshots.\n\n## Notes\n- Keep all project work inside this run's workspace; do not inspect sibling runs.\n- Use Playwright's WebKit as the available approximation of iOS Safari.\n- The original handoff, motion sources, and hub client are in the development folder; `vendor/fitclips.js` is the generated local clip set.\n\n--- hub client surface ---\n36:    /** True when the hub shows the round's splash and collects every player's ready: call ready() once loaded, with no prompt. */\n291:  hub.connect = function (opts) {\n313:      post('hello', { v: 1, client: VERSION, mode: opts.mode || null, seats: opts.seats || null, card: opts.card === true });\n320:  /** Everything is loaded: at once when info.splash, otherwise from the player's ready gesture. */\n321:  hub.ready = function () {\n327:  /** On the game's own card (connect({ card: true })): this player is 'ready', or asks for 'more' time (again takes it back). */\n330:    if (what !== 'ready' && what !== 'more') return warn('answer is ready or more');\n382:  hub.time = function () {\n422:  /** Race and side by side: report your own outcome once, {time: ms} (lower wins) or {score: n} (higher wins), with optional stats and awards. */\n423:  hub.result = function (outcome) {\n430:    if (finite(given.time)) fields.time = Number(given.time);\n432:    if (!own(fields, 'time') && !own(fields, 'score')) return warn('result needs a finite time or score');\n458:  hub.progress = function (p) {\n468:  hub.probe = function (fn) {\n\n--- current UI selectors ---\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
