{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_179","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; printf '\\\\n--- status ---\\\\n'; cat PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- class and hub ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'class|AIHub|function updateActivity|function completeActivity|function startActivity|function pollGamepad|function frame\\\\(' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | cut -c1-400; printf '\"'\\\\n--- art ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'function drawPerson|function drawWorld|drawPerson\\\\(' \\\"\"'$D/src/art.js\"; printf '\"'\\\\n--- mocap ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'FITCLIPS|const POINTS|POINTS|function load|clip:' \\\"\"'$D/vendor/mocap.js\" \"$D/vendor/readable.js\" \"$D/src/data.js\" | cut -c1-280 | head -50; printf '\"'\\\\n--- session ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'rng\\\\(|answer\\\\(|function time|function rng|probe|time-up|card' \\\"\"'$D/vendor/session.js\" | head -70'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_179","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; printf '\\\\n--- status ---\\\\n'; cat PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- class and hub ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'class|AIHub|function updateActivity|function completeActivity|function startActivity|function pollGamepad|function frame\\\\(' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | cut -c1-400; printf '\"'\\\\n--- art ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'function drawPerson|function drawWorld|drawPerson\\\\(' \\\"\"'$D/src/art.js\"; printf '\"'\\\\n--- mocap ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'FITCLIPS|const POINTS|POINTS|function load|clip:' \\\"\"'$D/vendor/mocap.js\" \"$D/vendor/readable.js\" \"$D/src/data.js\" | cut -c1-280 | head -50; printf '\"'\\\\n--- session ---\\\\n'; rg -n 'rng\\\\(|answer\\\\(|function time|function rng|probe|time-up|card' \\\"\"'$D/vendor/session.js\" | head -70'","aggregated_output":"\n--- status ---\n# Progress\n\n## Handoff\n- Game title: Wee Bit of Zen\n- Deliverable basename: `Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356`\n- Build a complete, single-file game from `PLAN.md` and follow `TASK.md` for the handoff.\n\n## Status\n- [x] Read the task and begin extracting the game design.\n- [x] Fetch the required engine, mocap clips, and AI Hub client and harness.\n- [x] Integrate the fixed-step engine and load the AI Hub client.\n- [x] Implement the island, 12 activities, story, saves, settings, and initial class mode.\n- [x] Produce the first self-contained HTML and a provisional structured exit interview.\n- [ ] Finish real multiplayer scoring, the three-event AI Hub session, and motion integration.\n- [ ] Exercise the game and inspect responsive, cross-browser screenshots; finalize the interview.\n\n## Notes\n- Keep all project work inside this run's workspace; do not inspect sibling runs.\n- Use Playwright's WebKit as the available approximation of iOS Safari.\n- The original handoff, motion sources, and hub client are in the development folder; `vendor/fitclips.js` is the generated local clip set.\n- Build with `node 'Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/build.mjs'`; this also copies the standalone build into the Hub harness.\n- A local preview is running at `http://127.0.0.1:32893/` in exec session `68330`; stop only that session when finished.\n- The first Chromium smoke test opened the standalone successfully. Title spacing, authentic class scoring, Hub sequencing, and applying the downloaded motion clips remain under review.\n\n--- class and hub ---\n11:  selection: null, activity: null, returnScreen: 'title', check: null, toast: '', classPlayers: [],\n12:  festival: false, festivalIndex: 0, hub: { active: !!window.AIHub?.active, started: false, finished: false, score: 0, lastSend: 0, lastProgress: 0, ghosts: {} }\n51:  return `<button class=\"action${primary ? ' primary' : ''}\" data-action=\"${action}\" data-id=\"${escapeHTML(id)}\"><span>${label}${detail ? `<small>${detail}</small>` : ''}</span><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button>`;\n54:  return `<div class=\"page\"><header class=\"topbar\"><button class=\"brand\" data-action=\"home\" aria-label=\"Return to title\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">✳</span><span>WEE BIT <b>OF ZEN</b></span></button><span class=\"top-label\">${label}</span><button class=\"settings-link\" data-action=\"settings\" aria-label=\"Settings\">⚙ <span>SETTINGS</span></button></header>${content}${footer ? `<footer class=\"footer\">\n61:  return `<button class=\"activity ${locked ? 'locked' : ''}\" data-action=\"${locked ? 'locked' : 'select-activity'}\" data-id=\"${activity.id}\" style=\"--group:${group.color};--group-light:${group.light}\"><span class=\"activity-icon\">${activity.icon}</span><span class=\"activity-copy\"><span class=\"activity-group\">${group.name}</span><strong>${activity.name}</strong><small>${locked ? `Opens day ${acti\n63:function settingRow(label, value, action, id = '') { return `<div class=\"row\"><span>${label}</span><button class=\"chip setting-button\" data-action=\"${action}\" data-id=\"${id}\">${value}</button></div>`; }\n66:  return sections.map(([title, value]) => `<div class=\"about-group\"><h3>${title}</h3>${Array.isArray(value) ? value.map((item, index) => `<p><b>${index + 1}.</b> ${escapeHTML(item)}</p>`).join('') : Object.entries(value || {}).map(([key, item]) => `<p><b>${escapeHTML(key)}:</b> ${escapeHTML(item)}</p>`).join('')}</div>`).join('');\n72:    content = `<main class=\"hero\"><section class=\"hero-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"sun-dot\">✳</span> A LITTLE ISLAND FOR YOURSELF</div><h1 class=\"logo\">wee bit<br><em>of zen</em><span class=\"logo-dot\">.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">A pleasantly imperfect retreat for<br>your body, mind, and general wobble.</p><div class=\"menu-stack\">${button('Begin your stay', 'slots', true, '', 'A lit\n73:    if (state.screen === 'attract') content += '<div class=\"center-copy\">DEMONSTRATION &nbsp; · &nbsp; PRESS ANY KEY</div>';\n76:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THE GUEST BOOK</div><h1>Make yourself at home.</h1><p>Choose a room for your island stay.</p></div></div><div class=\"card-grid\">${state.slots.map((slot, index) => `<button class=\"card slot-card\" data-action=\"slot\" data-id=\"${index}\"><span class=\"slot-num\">0${index + 1}</span><span class=\"slot-ava\n79:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; NICE TO MEET YOU</div><h1>A little about you.</h1><p>There is no wrong way to arrive.</p></div></div><div class=\"card setup-card\"><label class=\"field\">WHAT SHOULD WE CALL YOU?<input id=\"nickname\" maxlength=\"16\" value=\"${escapeHTML(member.name === 'Guest' ? '' : member.name)}\" placeholder=\"\n82:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"dialogue card\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; A NOTE FROM TARE</div><div class=\"speaker\">☺</div><h1>Welcome${member.day === 1 ? ', ' + escapeHTML(member.name) : ' back'}.</h1><p>“${DAY_INTROS[Math.min(4, member.day - 1)]}”</p><p class=\"note\">Your stay starts with a gentle body check. No weights, no judgement, and absolutely no pop quizzes\n85:    content = `<main class=\"play-hud\"><div class=\"hud-top\"><div class=\"hud-box\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; BODY CHECK</div><h2>Just checking in.</h2><p id=\"check-text\">Find a comfortable center.</p></div><div class=\"hud-box timer\" id=\"check-timer\">05</div></div><div class=\"hud-bottom\"><div class=\"play-instruction\">${state.check?.phase === 'lean' ? 'Lean in each direction: ← ↑ → ↓' : 'Stay st\n88:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ONE VERY SCIENTIFIC QUESTION</div><h1>How are you arriving today?</h1><p>Your answer helps us calibrate the island's extremely sophisticated vibes.</p><div class=\"menu-stack\">${button('Bright-eyed and bushy-tailed', 'question-answer', true, 'bright')}${button('A little wobbly, honestly', 'ques\n91:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ACCORDING TO TARE</div><div class=\"score-big\">${state.check.spine}</div><h1>Your Spine Age</h1><p>“A completely imaginary number. Your actual spine remains splendid.”</p><p class=\"note\">Today is a fine day to practice being here.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Explore the island', 'island',\n95:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap island-main\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ${labelDay()} &nbsp; / &nbsp; ${Math.floor(member.minutes || 0)} FIT MINUTES</div><h1>Find your kind of movement.</h1><p>${member.finished ? 'The island is yours. Stay as long as you like.' : `Hello, ${escapeHTML(member.name)}. Choose a mat and settle in.`}</p></div><div class=\"day-ba\n98:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card activity-detail\" style