{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_210","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; sed -n '1,170p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 200 | head -n 230; printf '\"'\\\\n---GAME REST TARGETS---\\\\n'; sed -n '180,365p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 200 | head -n 260; printf '\"'\\\\n---ART---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,180p' \\\"\"'$D/src/art.js\" | fold -w 200; printf '\"'\\\\n---DATA---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,90p' \\\"\"'$D/src/data.js\"; printf '\"'\\\\n---STATUS---\\\\n'; cat PROGRESS.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_210","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; sed -n '1,170p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 200 | head -n 230; printf '\"'\\\\n---GAME REST TARGETS---\\\\n'; sed -n '180,365p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 200 | head -n 260; printf '\"'\\\\n---ART---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,180p' \\\"\"'$D/src/art.js\" | fold -w 200; printf '\"'\\\\n---DATA---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,90p' \\\"\"'$D/src/data.js\"; printf '\"'\\\\n---STATUS---\\\\n'; cat PROGRESS.md\"","aggregated_output":"'use strict';\n\nconst app = document.getElementById('app');\nconst STORAGE = 'wee-bit-of-zen-v1';\nconst DEFAULT_SETTINGS = { music: 10, sound: 10, voice: true, gentle: false, breathToggle: false, tips: true, glyphs: 'PlayStation' };\nlet stored;\ntry { stored = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE) || '{}'); } catch (_) { stored = {}; }\nconst state = {\n  screen: 'title', clock: 0, idle: 0, input: 'keyboard', settings: { ...DEFAULT_SETTINGS, ...(stored.settings || {}) },\n  slots: Array.isArray(stored.slots) ? stored.slots : [null, null, null], slot: 0, member: null,\n  selection: null, activity: null, returnScreen: 'title', check: null, toast: '', classPlayers: [],\n  festival: false, festivalIndex: 0, hub: { active: !!window.AIHub?.active, started: false, finished: false, score: 0, lastSend: 0, lastProgress: 0, ghosts: {} }\n};\nwhile (state.slots.length < 3) state.slots.push(null);\nconst keys = new Set();\nlet mouseLean = null, lastFrame = 0, lastHud = 0, audioContext = null, nextMusic = 0, gamepadPrevious = [];\nlet toggledBreath = false, pausedFrom = null;\n\nfunction save() {\n  if (state.hub.active) return;\n  if (state.member) state.slots[state.slot] = state.member;\n  try { localStorage.setItem(STORAGE, JSON.stringify({ settings: state.settings, slots: state.slots })); } catch (_) { notify('Saving is unavailable in this browser.'); }\n}\nfunction notify(text) {\n  state.toast = text;\n  const node = document.getElementById('toast');\n  if (node) { node.textContent = text; node.hidden = false; }\n  setTimeout(() => { if (state.toast === text) { state.toast = ''; const toast = document.getElementById('toast'); if (toast) toast.hidden = true; } }, 3000);\n}\nfunction tone(frequency, duration = .14, volume = .5, type = 'sine') {\n  if (!audioContext || audioContext.state !== 'running' || !state.settings.sound) return;\n  const oscillator = audioContext.createOscillator(), gain = audioContext.createGain(), now = audioContext.currentTime;\n  oscillator.type = type; oscillator.frequency.setValueAtTime(frequency, now);\n  gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001, now); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(.00011, state.settings.sound / 100 * volume * .18), now + .015); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001, n\now + duration);\n  oscillator.connect(gain); gain.connect(audioContext.destination); oscillator.start(now); oscillator.stop(now + duration + .01);\n}\nfunction unlockAudio() {\n  try { if (!audioContext) audioContext = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)(); if (audioContext.state === 'suspended') audioContext.resume(); } catch (_) {}\n}\nfunction music() {\n  if (!audioContext || audioContext.state !== 'running' || !state.settings.music || state.clock < nextMusic) return;\n  nextMusic = state.clock + 1.25;\n  const notes = [261.63, 329.63, 392, 493.88, 392, 329.63, 293.66, 349.23];\n  const oscillator = audioContext.createOscillator(), gain = audioContext.createGain(), now = audioContext.currentTime;\n  oscillator.type = 'sine'; oscillator.frequency.value = notes[Math.floor(state.clock / 1.25) % notes.length];\n  gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001, now); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(.00011, state.settings.music / 100 * .035), now + .08); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001, now + 1.1)\n;\n  oscillator.connect(gain); gain.connect(audioContext.destination); oscillator.start(now); oscillator.stop(now + 1.15);\n}\nfunction hint() { return state.input === 'gamepad' ? (state.settings.glyphs === 'Xbox' ? 'A SELECT  ·  B BACK' : '✕ SELECT  ·  ○ BACK') : '↑ ↓ CHOOSE  ·  ENTER SELECT  ·  ESC BACK'; }\nfunction button(label, action, primary = false, id = '', detail = '') {\n  return `<button class=\"action${primary ? ' primary' : ''}\" data-action=\"${action}\" data-id=\"${escapeHTML(id)}\"><span>${label}${detail ? `<small>${detail}</small>` : ''}</span><span class=\"arrow\">↗</\nspan></button>`;\n}\nfunction shell(content, label = '', footer = true) {\n  return `<div class=\"page\"><header class=\"topbar\"><button class=\"brand\" data-action=\"home\" aria-label=\"Return to title\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">✳</span><span>WEE BIT <b>OF ZEN</b></span></button><sp\nan class=\"top-label\">${label}</span><button class=\"settings-link\" data-action=\"settings\" aria-label=\"Settings\">⚙ <span>SETTINGS</span></button></header>${content}${footer ? `<footer class=\"footer\"><sp\nan>${hint()}</span><span>THE INSTITUTE FOR GENTLE IMPROVEMENT&nbsp; ✳ &nbsp; LUMBAR ISLAND</span></footer>` : ''}</div><div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" hidden></div>`;\n}\nfunction screen(name) { state.screen = name; state.idle = 0; render(); }\nfunction person() { return state.member || { name: 'Guest', day: 1, sessions: 0, minutes: 0, stars: {}, instructor: 'Birch', color: 1, outfit: 1, finished: false }; }\nfunction labelDay() { const member = person(); return member.finished ? 'FREE PRACTICE' : `DAY ${member.day} OF 5`; }\nfunction tile(activity, locked = false) {\n  const group = GROUPS[activity.group], stars = person().stars?.[activity.id] || 0;\n  return `<button class=\"activity ${locked ? 'locked' : ''}\" data-action=\"${locked ? 'locked' : 'select-activity'}\" data-id=\"${activity.id}\" style=\"--group:${group.color};--group-light:${group.light}\"\n><span class=\"activity-icon\">${activity.icon}</span><span class=\"activity-copy\"><span class=\"activity-group\">${group.name}</span><strong>${activity.name}</strong><small>${locked ? `Opens day ${activit\ny.day}` : activity.tagline}</small></span><span class=\"activity-end\">${locked ? '⌁' : (stars ? '★'.repeat(stars) : '↗')}</span></button>`;\n}\nfunction settingRow(label, value, action, id = '') { return `<div class=\"row\"><span>${label}</span><button class=\"chip setting-button\" data-action=\"${action}\" data-id=\"${id}\">${value}</button></div>`;\n }\nfunction aboutContent() {\n  const info = window.BUILD_INFO || {}, sections = [ ['Source Information', info.sourceInformation], ['Testing Feedback', info.testingFeedback], ['Engine Feedback', info.engineFeedback], ['Prompt Feed\nback', info.promptFeedback] ];\n  return sections.map(([title, value]) => `<div class=\"about-group\"><h3>${title}</h3>${Array.isArray(value) ? value.map((item, index) => `<p><b>${index + 1}.</b> ${escapeHTML(item)}</p>`).join('') : O\nbject.entries(value || {}).map(([key, item]) => `<p><b>${escapeHTML(key)}:</b> ${escapeHTML(item)}</p>`).join('')}</div>`).join('');\n}\nfunction render() {\n  const member = person();\n  let content = '', heading = '';\n  if (state.screen === 'title' || state.screen === 'attract') {\n    content = `<main class=\"hero\"><section class=\"hero-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"sun-dot\">✳</span> A LITTLE ISLAND FOR YOURSELF</div><h1 class=\"logo\">wee bit<br><em>of zen</em><span clas\ns=\"logo-dot\">.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">A pleasantly imperfect retreat for<br>your body, mind, and general wobble.</p><div class=\"menu-stack\">${button('Begin your stay', 'slots', true, '', 'A little\n time just for you')}${button('Local Class', 'class', false, '', 'Practice together, up to four')}${button('About & credits', 'about')}</div></section><div class=\"island-message\"><span>✦ &nbsp; TAKE I\nT AT YOUR OWN PACE</span><strong>Good things happen<br>one wobble at a time.</strong></div></main>`;\n    if (state.screen === 'attract') content += '<div class=\"center-copy\">DEMONSTRATION &nbsp; · &nbsp; PRESS ANY KEY</div>';\n  } else if (state.screen === 'slots') {\n    heading = 'YOUR STAY';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THE GUEST BOOK</div><h1>Make yourself at home.</h1><p>Choose a room for your island stay.</p></div><\n/div><div class=\"card-grid\">${state.slots.map((slot, index) => `<button class=\"card slot-card\" data-action=\"slot\" data-id=\"${index}\"><span class=\"slot-num\">0${index + 1}</span><span class=\"slot-avatar\n\">${slot ? '☺' : '+'}</span><strong>${slot ? escapeHTML(slot.name) : 'New member'}</strong><small>${slot ? `${slot.finished ? 'Free practice' : `Day ${slot.day}`} · ${Math.floor(slot.minutes || 0)} fi\nt minutes` : 'A fresh start awaits'}</small><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', 'home')}</div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'setup') {\n    heading = 'NEW MEMBER';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; NICE TO MEET YOU</div><h1>A little about you.</h1><p>There is no wrong way to arrive.</p></di\nv></div><div class=\"card setup-card\"><label class=\"field\">WHAT SHOULD WE CALL YOU?<input id=\"nickname\" maxlength=\"16\" value=\"${escapeHTML(member.name === 'Guest' ? '' : member.name)}\" placeholder=\"You\nr name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><p class=\"field-label\">CHOOSE YOUR COLOUR</p><div class=\"options\">${OUTFITS.map((color, index) => `<button class=\"option swatch ${member.outfit === index ? 'selected\n' : ''}\" data-action=\"outfit\" data-id=\"${index}\" style=\"--swatch:${color}\" aria-label=\"Outfit ${index + 1}\">${member.outfit === index ? '✓' : ''}</button>`).join('')}</div><p class=\"field-label\">YOUR \nINSTRUCTOR</p><div class=\"options\">${['Birch', 'Alder'].map(name => `<button class=\"option ${member.instructor === name ? 'selected' : ''}\" data-action=\"instructor\" data-id=\"${name}\">${name === 'Birch\n' ? '✳' : '✦'} &nbsp; ${name}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', 'slots')}${button('Arrive on the island', 'create-member', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'intro') {\n    heading = labelDay();\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"dialogue card\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; A NOTE FROM TARE</div><div class=\"speaker\">☺</div><h1>Welcome${member.day === 1 ? ', ' + escapeHT\nML(member.name) : ' back'}.</h1><p>“${DAY_INTROS[Math.min(4, member.day - 1)]}”</p><p class=\"note\">Your stay starts with a gentle body check. No weights, no judgement, and absolutely no pop quizzes. W\nell, one tiny quiz.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Begin body check', 'check', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'check') {\n    heading = 'BODY CHECK';\n    content = `<main class=\"play-hud\"><div class=\"hud-top\"><div class=\"hud-box\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; BODY CHECK</div><h2>Just checking in.</h2><p id=\"check-text\">Find a comfortable center.</p\n></div><div class=\"hud-box timer\" id=\"check-timer\">05</div></div><div class=\"hud-bottom\"><div class=\"play-instruction\">${state.check?.phase === 'lean' ? 'Lean in each direction: ← ↑ → ↓' : 'Stay stead\ny. Small wobbles are welcome.'}</div><div class=\"meter\"><span id=\"check-progress\"></span></div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'question') {\n    heading = 'BODY CHECK';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ONE VERY SCIENTIFIC QUESTION</div><h1>How are you arriving today?</h1><p>Your answer helps us cal\nibrate the island's extremely sophisticated vibes.</p><div class=\"menu-stack\">${button('Bright-eyed and bushy-tailed', 'question-answer', true, 'bright')}${button('A little wobbly, honestly', 'questio\nn-answer', false, 'wobbly')}${button('Mostly thinking about snacks', 'question-answer', false, 'snacks')}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'check-result') {\n    heading = 'BODY CHECK COMPLETE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ACCORDING TO TARE</div><div class=\"score-big\">${state.check.spine}</div><h1>Your Spine Age</h1><p\n>“A completely imaginary number. Your actual spine remains splendid.”</p><p class=\"note\">Today is a fine day to practice being here.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Explore the island', 'island', tr\nue)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'island') {\n    heading = labelDay();\n    const dialogue = CAST[(member.day + member.sessions) % CAST.length];\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap island-main\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ${labelDay()} &nbsp; / &nbsp; ${Math.floor(member.minutes || 0)} FIT MINUTES</div><h1>Fi\nnd your kind of movement.</h1><p>${member.finished ? 'The island is yours. Stay as long as you like.' : `Hello, ${escapeHTML(member.name)}. Choose a mat and settle in.`}</p></div><div class=\"day-badge\n\"><strong>${member.sessions || 0}<small>/ 3</small></strong><span>TODAY'S<br>SESSIONS</span></div></div><div class=\"activity-grid\">${ACTIVITIES.map(activity => tile(activity, !member.finished && activ\nity.day > member.day)).join('')}</div><div class=\"island-bar\"><p><b>${dialogue[0]} says:</b> “${dialogue[1]}”</p><div class=\"map-actions\">${button('Local Class', 'class')}${button(member.finished ? 'Y\nour story' : member.day === 5 ? 'Gentle Games' : 'End the day', member.finished ? 'ending' : 'sleep', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'activity') {\n    const activity = state.selection, group = GROUPS[activity.group]; heading = group.name.toUpperCase();\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card activity-detail\" style=\"--group:${group.color};--group-light:${group.light}\"><div class=\"activity-large-icon\">${activity.icon}</div><div \nclass=\"eyebrow\">${group.icon} &nbsp; ${group.name.toUpperCase()} &nbsp; / &nbsp; ${activity.seconds} SECONDS</div><h1>${activity.name}</h1><p>${activity.tagline}</p><div class=\"divider\"></div><h3>How \nto play</h3><p>${activity.instruction}</p><p class=\"note\">Lean with WASD, arrow keys, left stick or mouse. ${state.settings.gentle ? 'Gentle mode is on.' : 'Make small, comfortable movements.'}</p><di\nv class=\"actions\">${button('Back to island', state.classMode ? 'class' : 'island')}${button('Begin practice', 'start-activity', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'play') {\n    const activity = state.activity, group = GROUPS[activity.group]; heading = group.name.toUpperCase();\n    content = `<main class=\"play-hud\"><div class=\"hud-top\"><div class=\"hud-box\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">${group.icon} &nbsp; ${group.name.toUpperCase()}</div><h2>${activity.name}</h2><p id=\"play-status\">\nFind your center.</p></div><div class=\"hud-box timer\"><span id=\"play-timer\">${Math.ceil(activity.seconds)}</span><small>SEC</small></div></div><div class=\"balance-plate\" aria-label=\"Balance indicator\"\n><span class=\"plate-ring\" id=\"plate-ring\"></span><span class=\"plate-dot\" id=\"plate-dot\"></span></div><div class=\"hud-bottom\"><div class=\"play-instruction\" id=\"play-instruction\">${activity.instruction}\n</div><div class=\"meter\"><span id=\"play-progress\"></span></div><div class=\"hud-caption\"><span id=\"play-score\">A GENTLE START</span><span>ESC / OPTIONS &nbsp; PAUSE</span></div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'result') {\n    const result = state.result;\n    heading = 'SESSION COMPLETE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue result-card\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; PRACTICE COMPLETE</div><div class=\"stars-big\">${'★'.repeat(result.stars)}<span>${'☆'.\nrepeat(3 - result.stars)}</span></div><h1>Lovely work${state.classMode ? ', everyone' : ''}.</h1><p>“${result.message}”</p><div class=\"result-stats\"><div><strong>${result.percent}%</strong><small>STEA\nDINESS</small></div><div><strong>+${result.minutes}</strong><small>FIT MINUTES</small></div><div><strong>${result.stumbles}</strong><small>WOBBLES</small></div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Pra\nctice again', 'retry')}${button(state.festival ? 'Continue the Games' : state.classMode ? 'Class results' : 'Back to island', 'result-continue', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'recap') {\n    heading = 'DAY COMPLETE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ANOTHER DAY WELL SPENT</div><h1>Rest is part of it.</h1><p>“${member.sessions} sessions today. Ge\nrald the ceramic hippo has made a careful note.”</p><div class=\"result-stats\"><div><strong>${Math.floor(member.minutes)}</strong><small>FIT MINUTES</small></div><div><strong>${Object.keys(member.stars\n || {}).length}</strong><small>MATS VISITED</small></div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Wake up to day ' + (member.day + 1), 'next-day', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'festival') {\n    heading = 'DAY 5 &nbsp; / &nbsp; GENTLE GAMES';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THE GENTLE GAMES</div><h1>Ready, steady,<br><em>be yourself.</em></h1><p>Three friendly challenge\ns, ending in the Grand Stillness with Gertrude. The prize is a very nice feeling.</p><p class=\"note\">Challenge ${state.festivalIndex + 1} of 3 &nbsp; · &nbsp; ${['Stork Stand', 'Slalom', 'Quiet Candle\n'][state.festivalIndex]}</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Begin challenge', 'festival-start', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'ending') {\n    heading = 'THANK YOU FOR STAYING';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; YOUR ISLAND IS ALWAYS HERE</div><div class=\"stars-big\">✳</div><h1>A little steadier.<br><em>A lot\n more you.</em></h1><p>Gertrude awards you the Golden Composure. Dennis is emotional. Tare insists the award is calibrated.</p><p class=\"note\">Thank you for five days of moving, breathing, and making \nroom. The mats are yours whenever you wish.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Explore freely', 'free-play', true)}${button('About & credits', 'about')}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'class') {\n    heading = 'LOCAL CLASS';\n    const players = state.classPlayers;\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; BETTER TOGETHER</div><h1>Make room for friends.</h1><p>Up to four share the same screen. One keyboar\nd player; connect controllers for more.</p></div></div><div class=\"class-players\">${[0, 1, 2, 3].map((index) => `<div class=\"card player-tile\"><span class=\"slot-avatar\">${players[index] ? '☺' : '+'}</\nspan><strong>${players[index] ? escapeHTML(players[index].name) : 'Open spot'}</strong><small>${players[index] ? escapeHTML(players[index].type) : 'Join or add a bot'}</small><button class=\"chip\" data\n-action=\"class-toggle\" data-id=\"${index}\">${players[index] ? 'REMOVE' : 'ADD BOT'}</button></div>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"card class-select\"><p>CHOOSE A CLASS</p><div class=\"options\">${['stork','\ncandle','step','slalom','tray'].map(id => `<button class=\"option ${state.selection?.id === id ? 'selected' : ''}\" data-action=\"class-activity\" data-id=\"${id}\">${ACTIVITIES.find(a => a.id === id).name}\n</button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', member.name === 'Guest' ? 'home' : 'island')}${button('Start class', 'start-class', true)}</div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'class-result') {\n    heading = 'LOCAL CLASS';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; EVERYONE SHOWED UP</div><h1>A class act.</h1><p>Everyone gets their own kind of gold star.</p>${s\ntate.classPlayers.map((player, index) => `<div class=\"row\"><span>${escapeHTML(player.name)} ${player.type === 'Bot' ? '· BOT' : ''}</span><b>${Math.max(30, state.result.percent - index * 5)} points &n\nbsp; ★</b></div>`).join('')}<div class=\"actions\">${button('Back to class', 'class', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'settings') {\n    heading = 'SETTINGS';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; MAKE YOURSELF COMFORTABLE</div><h1>Your settings.</h1></div></div><div class=\"card settings-c\nard\">${settingRow('Music', state.settings.music + '%', 'volume', 'music')}${settingRow('Sound effects', state.settings.sound + '%', 'volume', 'sound')}${settingRow('Voice sounds', state.settings.voice\n ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'voice')}${settingRow('Gentle mode', state.settings.gentle ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'gentle')}${settingRow('Breathing', state.settings.breathToggle ? 'TOGGLE' : 'HOLD', 'to\nggle', 'breathToggle')}${settingRow('Tips', state.settings.tips ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'tips')}${settingRow('Controller symbols', state.settings.glyphs.toUpperCase(), 'glyphs')}<p class=\"note\">Sele\nct a volume to cycle from 0% to 100%. Gentle mode makes balancing more forgiving.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Done', 'settings-back', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'pause') {\n    heading = 'PAUSED';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; TAKE YOUR TIME</div><h1>Pause is a practice, too.</h1><div class=\"menu-stack\">${button('Resume', \n'resume', true)}${button('Restart session', 'restart')}${button('Settings', 'settings')}${state.hub.active ? '' : button('Developer mode', 'dev')}${state.hub.active ? '' : button('Leave session', 'lea\nve-play')}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'dev') {\n    heading = 'DEVELOPER MODE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card settings-card\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; LIVE TUNING</div><h1>Behind the wobble.</h1>${[['spring','Spring',4,20,.5],['damping','Dampi\nng',1,12,.5],['instability','Instability',0,4,.1],['noise','Disturbance',0,.8,.05]].map(([key, name, min, max, step]) => `<label class=\"slider\">${name} <output id=\"out-${key}\">${tuning[key]}</output><\ninput type=\"range\" data-tuning=\"${key}\" min=\"${min}\" max=\"${max}\" step=\"${step}\" value=\"${tuning[key]}\"></label>`).join('')}<div class=\"actions\">${button('Reset tuning', 'reset-tuning')}${button('Back\n to pause', 'pause', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'about') {\n    heading = 'ABOUT & CREDITS';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card scroll\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; A LITTLE NOTE FROM THE MAKERS</div><h1>About & credits.</h1><p>Made with care for everyone who has \never wobbled.</p>${aboutContent()}<div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', 'about-back', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'hub') {\n    heading = 'AI HUB &nbsp; / &nbsp; GHOST CLASS';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THREE MINUTES TOGETHER</div><h1>${state.hub.finished ? 'Class complete.' : 'A little steadiness, \nshared.'}</h1><p>${state.hub.finished ? 'Your result has been sent to the Hub.' : 'Stork Stand, Step Class, and Quiet Candle. The steadiest practice wins; everyone gets a moment to breathe.'}</p><div \nclass=\"result-stats\"><div><strong>${Math.round(state.hub.score)}</strong><small>POINTS</small></div></div><p class=\"note\">${state.hub.started ? 'The class is underway.' : 'Waiting for the other guests\n…'}</p></div></main>`;\n  }\n  app.innerHTML = shell(content, heading, state.screen !== 'play' && state.screen !== 'check');\n  if (state.screen === 'play') updateHUD();\n  if (state.screen === 'check') updateCheckHUD();\n  const touchOnly = matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches && !Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.() || []).some(Boolean);\n  if (touchOnly && !['settings','about'].includes(state.screen)) {\n    const notice = document.createElement('div'); notice.className = 'touch-notice'; notice.innerHTML = '<div><span>✳</span><h2>Controller or keyboard required</h2><p>Connect a controller or keyboard \nto enjoy the island.</p><button class=\"action primary\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button></div>'; app.appendChild(notice);\n  }\n}\nfunction currentButtons() { return [...app.querySelectorAll('button:not([disabled])')].filter(node => node.offsetParent !== null && !node.closest('.touch-notice')); }\nfunction focusMove(direction) {\n  const buttons = currentButtons(); if (!buttons.length) return;\n  const index = buttons.indexOf(document.activeElement); buttons[(index + direction + buttons.length) % buttons.length].focus();\n}\nfunction memberDefault() { return { name: 'Guest', day: 1, sessions: 0, minutes: 0, stars: {}, instructor: 'Birch', color: 1, outfit: 1, finished: false }; }\nfunction beginCheck() { state.check = { phase: 'still', elapsed: 0, directions: new Set(), spine: 25 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 25) }; state.activity = null; screen('check'); }\nfunction startActivity(activity, options = {}) {\n  const selected = { ...activity }, duration = options.seconds || selected.seconds;\n  state.selection = selected;\n  state.activity = { ...selected, seconds: duration, elapsed: 0, px: 0, py: 0, vx: 0, vy: 0, ux: 0, uy: 0, ringX: 0, ringY: 0, flame: .6, score: 0, samples: 0, stumbles: 0, stun: 0, effort: 0, reps: 0\n, beatHits: 0, lastBeat: -1, lastJog: '', jogHits: 0, hoopHits: 0, good: 0, tray: 0, lastDirection: 0, motions: 0, rng: seeded(841 + selected.name.length) };\n  mouseLean = null; keys.clear(); toggledBreath = false; screen('play');\n}\nfunction completeActivity() {\n  const activity = state.activity;\n\n---GAME REST TARGETS---\n  if ((key === ' ' || key === 'enter') && state.settings.breathToggle) toggledBreath = !toggledBreath;\n}\nconst tuningDefaults = { spring: 11, damping: 6, instability: 1.3, noise: .19 };\nconst tuning = { ...tuningDefaults };\nfunction updateActivity(dt) {\n  const activity = state.activity; if (!activity) return;\n  activity.elapsed += dt;\n  const pad = Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.() || []).find(Boolean), axisX = pad && Math.abs(pad.axes[0]) > .12 ? pad.axes[0] : 0, axisY = pad && Math.abs(pad.axes[1]) > .12 ? pad.axes[1] : 0;\n  const dx = (keys.has('arrowright') || keys.has('d') ? 1 : 0) - (keys.has('arrowleft') || keys.has('a') ? 1 : 0);\n  const dy = (keys.has('arrowdown') || keys.has('s') ? 1 : 0) - (keys.has('arrowup') || keys.has('w') ? 1 : 0);\n  if (activity.stun <= 0) {\n    if (mouseLean) { activity.ux = mouseLean.x; activity.uy = mouseLean.y; }\n    else if (axisX || axisY) { activity.ux = axisX; activity.uy = axisY; }\n    else { activity.ux = clamp(activity.ux + dx * 2.2 * dt, -1, 1); activity.uy = clamp(activity.uy + dy * 2.2 * dt, -1, 1); if (!dx) activity.ux *= Math.max(0, 1 - .5 * dt); if (!dy) activity.uy *= M\nath.max(0, 1 - .5 * dt); }\n  } else activity.stun -= dt;\n  const gentle = state.settings.gentle ? .7 : 1, time = activity.elapsed, disturbance = tuning.noise * gentle;\n  const ax = tuning.spring * (activity.ux - activity.px) - tuning.damping * activity.vx + tuning.instability * gentle * activity.px + disturbance * (Math.sin(time * 1.7) + .5 * Math.sin(time * 3.23));\n  const ay = tuning.spring * (activity.uy - activity.py) - tuning.damping * activity.vy + tuning.instability * gentle * activity.py + disturbance * (Math.sin(time * 1.19 + 1) + .5 * Math.sin(time * 2.\n71));\n  activity.vx += ax * dt; activity.vy += ay * dt; activity.px += activity.vx * dt; activity.py += activity.vy * dt;\n  if (Math.hypot(activity.px, activity.py) >= 1 && activity.stun <= 0) { activity.stumbles++; activity.stun = 1; activity.px *= .5; activity.py *= .5; activity.vx *= -.2; activity.vy *= -.2; tone(196,\n .18); }\n  const phase = Math.floor(time / 12), rng = seeded(phase * 667 + 43);\n  activity.ringX = activity.id === 'stork' ? (rng() - .5) * .65 : activity.kind === 'slalom' ? Math.sin(time * .55) * .46 : 0;\n  activity.ringY = activity.id === 'stork' ? (rng() - .5) * .35 : 0;\n  const distance = Math.hypot(activity.px - activity.ringX, activity.py - activity.ringY), ringSize = state.settings.gentle ? .48 : .38;\n  const steadiness = clamp(1 - distance * 1.4, 0, 1);\n  let quality = steadiness;\n  const held = state.settings.breathToggle ? toggledBreath : keys.has(' ') || !!pad?.buttons[7]?.pressed;\n  activity.effort = clamp(activity.effort + (held ? 1 : -1) * dt / 4, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'rep') { const goal = (Math.sin(time * Math.PI / 2 - Math.PI / 2) + 1) / 2; quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.effort - goal), 0, 1) * steadiness; activity.reps = Math.floor\n(time / 4); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'breath') { const inhale = Math.sin(time * Math.PI / 4) > 0; quality = steadiness * (held === inhale ? 1 : .5); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'step') quality = clamp(activity.beatHits / Math.max(1, time * 100 / 60) * 1.5, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'hoop') { activity.motions += (Math.abs(activity.vx) + Math.abs(activity.vy)) * dt; quality = clamp(activity.motions / Math.max(1, time) * 3 + activity.hoopHits / Math.max(1, t\nime / 10), 0, 1); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'jog') quality = clamp(activity.jogHits / Math.max(1, time * 2) * 1.5, 0, 1) * steadiness;\n  if (activity.kind === 'slalom') quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.px - activity.ringX) * 1.5, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'tray') { activity.tray += (activity.px - activity.tray) * dt * 1.5; quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.tray) * 2, 0, 1); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'rope') quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.px) * 2, 0, 1) * (activity.uy < -.1 ? 1 : .65);\n  if (activity.kind === 'candle') { activity.flame = clamp(activity.flame + (distance < ringSize ? .13 : -.3) * dt, 0, 1); quality = activity.flame; }\n  activity.score += quality; activity.samples++;\n  if (state.hub.active) {\n    const now = window.AIHub.time();\n    if (now - state.hub.lastSend >= 100) { state.hub.lastSend = now; window.AIHub.send({ x: activity.px, y: activity.py, exercise: activity.id }); }\n    if (now - state.hub.lastProgress >= 1000) { state.hub.lastProgress = now; window.AIHub.progress({ score: Math.round(state.hub.score + activity.score / Math.max(1, activity.samples) * 1000), label:\n activity.name }); }\n  }\n  if (activity.elapsed >= activity.seconds) completeActivity();\n}\nfunction updateHUD() {\n  const activity = state.activity; if (!activity) return;\n  const timer = document.getElementById('play-timer'), status = document.getElementById('play-status'), instruction = document.getElementById('play-instruction'), progress = document.getElementById('p\nlay-progress'), dot = document.getElementById('plate-dot'), ring = document.getElementById('plate-ring'), score = document.getElementById('play-score');\n  if (!timer) return;\n  timer.textContent = Math.max(0, Math.ceil(activity.seconds - activity.elapsed));\n  if (activity.kind === 'step') { const arrows = ['←','↑','→','↓']; const beat = Math.round(activity.elapsed * 100 / 60); status.textContent = `NEXT STEP  ${arrows[(beat + 4) % 4]}   ·   ${activity.be\natHits} on beat`; instruction.textContent = `Press ${arrows[(beat + 4) % 4]} on the beat · ${activity.instruction}`; }\n  else if (activity.kind === 'rep') status.textContent = `Rep ${activity.reps + 1} · ${Math.sin(activity.elapsed * Math.PI / 2 - Math.PI / 2) > 0 ? 'Rise gently' : 'Lower gently'}`;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'breath') status.textContent = Math.sin(activity.elapsed * Math.PI / 4) > 0 ? 'Breathe in · hold' : 'Breathe out · release';\n  else if (activity.kind === 'candle') status.textContent = `Flame ${Math.round(activity.flame * 100)}% · ${activity.flame < .15 ? 'settle to relight' : 'let it glow'}`;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'jog') status.textContent = `${activity.jogHits} steps · alternate J and K`;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'hoop') status.textContent = `${activity.hoopHits} catches · circle your lean`;\n  else status.textContent = activity.stun > 0 ? 'A wobble! Take a moment.' : 'Find the ring. Breathe naturally.';\n  progress.style.width = `${clamp(activity.elapsed / activity.seconds * 100, 0, 100)}%`;\n  dot.style.transform = `translate(${activity.px * 70}px, ${activity.py * 70}px)`;\n  ring.style.transform = `translate(${activity.ringX * 70}px, ${activity.ringY * 70}px)`;\n  score.textContent = `${Math.round(activity.score / Math.max(1, activity.samples) * 100)}% STEADY`;\n}\nfunction updateCheckHUD() {\n  if (!state.check) return;\n  const timer = document.getElementById('check-timer'), text = document.getElementById('check-text'), progress = document.getElementById('check-progress');\n  if (!timer) return;\n  timer.textContent = state.check.phase === 'still' ? String(Math.max(0, Math.ceil(5 - state.check.elapsed))).padStart(2, '0') : `${state.check.directions.size}/4`;\n  text.textContent = state.check.phase === 'still' ? 'Find a comfortable center.' : 'Lean left, up, right and down.';\n  progress.style.width = `${state.check.phase === 'still' ? clamp(state.check.elapsed / 5 * 50, 0, 50) : 50 + state.check.directions.size * 12.5}%`;\n}\nfunction update(dt) {\n  state.clock += dt;\n  if (state.screen === 'title') { state.idle += dt; if (state.idle >= 10 && !state.hub.active) screen('attract'); }\n  if (state.screen === 'check') { state.check.elapsed += dt; if (state.check.phase === 'still' && state.check.elapsed >= 5) { state.check.phase = 'lean'; state.check.elapsed = 0; } if (state.check.pha\nse === 'lean' && (state.check.directions.size === 4 || state.check.elapsed >= 14)) screen('question'); }\n  if (state.screen === 'play') updateActivity(dt);\n}\nfunction action(name, id) {\n  unlockAudio(); state.idle = 0; tone(440, .07, .2);\n  switch (name) {\n    case 'home': if (!state.hub.active) { state.classMode = false; screen('title'); } break;\n    case 'slots': screen('slots'); break;\n    case 'slot': state.slot = Number(id); state.member = state.slots[state.slot] || memberDefault(); state.classMode = false; screen(state.slots[state.slot] ? 'island' : 'setup'); break;\n    case 'outfit': state.member.outfit = Number(id); render(); break;\n    case 'instructor': state.member.instructor = id; render(); break;\n    case 'create-member': { const value = document.getElementById('nickname')?.value.trim(); state.member.name = (value || 'Guest').slice(0, 16); save(); screen('intro'); break; }\n    case 'check': beginCheck(); break;\n    case 'question-answer': state.check.answer = id; screen('check-result'); break;\n    case 'island': state.classMode = false; screen('island'); break;\n    case 'select-activity': state.selection = ACTIVITIES.find(activity => activity.id === id); state.classMode = false; screen('activity'); break;\n    case 'locked': notify('A new mat opens on a later day.'); break;\n    case 'start-activity': startActivity(state.selection); break;\n    case 'retry': startActivity(state.selection, { seconds: state.festival ? 30 : undefined }); break;\n    case 'result-continue': if (state.festival) { state.festivalIndex++; if (state.festivalIndex >= 3) { state.festival = false; state.member.finished = true; save(); screen('ending'); } else screen('\nfestival'); } else if (state.classMode) screen('class-result'); else screen('island'); break;\n    case 'sleep': if (memberDefault && state.member.sessions < 3) notify('Try three sessions before calling it a day.'); else if (state.member.day === 5) { state.festival = true; state.festivalIndex =\n 0; screen('festival'); } else screen('recap'); break;\n    case 'next-day': state.member.day = Math.min(5, state.member.day + 1); state.member.sessions = 0; save(); screen('intro'); break;\n    case 'festival-start': startActivity(ACTIVITIES.find(activity => activity.id === ['stork','slalom','candle'][state.festivalIndex]), { seconds: 30 }); break;\n    case 'ending': screen('ending'); break;\n    case 'free-play': state.member.finished = true; save(); screen('island'); break;\n    case 'class': state.classMode = true; if (!state.classPlayers.length) state.classPlayers = [{ name: state.member?.name || 'Player 1', type: 'Keyboard / pad' }, { name: 'Gertrude', type: 'Bot' }]; \nstate.selection = state.selection || ACTIVITIES[0]; screen('class'); break;\n    case 'class-toggle': { const index = Number(id); if (index === 0) break; state.classPlayers[index] = state.classPlayers[index] ? null : { name: ['Player 1','Gertrude','Dennis','Marisol'][index], t\nype: 'Bot' }; render(); break; }\n    case 'class-activity': state.selection = ACTIVITIES.find(activity => activity.id === id); render(); break;\n    case 'start-class': state.classPlayers = state.classPlayers.filter(Boolean); if (state.classPlayers.length < 2) { notify('Add at least one friend or bot.'); break; } startActivity(state.selection)\n; break;\n    case 'settings': state.returnScreen = state.screen; screen('settings'); break;\n    case 'settings-back': save(); screen(state.returnScreen || 'title'); break;\n    case 'toggle': state.settings[id] = !state.settings[id]; save(); render(); break;\n    case 'volume': state.settings[id] = state.settings[id] >= 100 ? 0 : state.settings[id] + 10; save(); render(); break;\n    case 'glyphs': state.settings.glyphs = state.settings.glyphs === 'Xbox' ? 'PlayStation' : 'Xbox'; save(); render(); break;\n    case 'pause': pausedFrom = state.screen === 'play' ? 'play' : pausedFrom; screen('pause'); break;\n    case 'resume': screen(pausedFrom || 'play'); break;\n    case 'restart': startActivity(state.selection, { seconds: state.festival ? 30 : undefined }); break;\n    case 'leave-play': state.festival = false; state.classMode ? screen('class') : screen('island'); break;\n    case 'dev': screen('dev'); break;\n    case 'reset-tuning': Object.assign(tuning, tuningDefaults); render(); break;\n    case 'about': state.aboutReturn = state.screen; screen('about'); break;\n    case 'about-back': screen(state.aboutReturn || 'title'); break;\n  }\n}\napp.addEventListener('click', event => { const target = event.target.closest('[data-action]'); if (target) action(target.dataset.action, target.dataset.id); });\napp.addEventListener('mouseover', event => { const target = event.target.closest('button'); if (target && state.input !== 'gamepad') target.focus({ preventScroll: true }); });\napp.addEventListener('input', event => { const key = event.target.dataset.tuning; if (key) { tuning[key] = Number(event.target.value); document.getElementById(`out-${key}`).value = tuning[key]; } });\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown', event => {\n  if (event.repeat && event.key !== ' ') return;\n  state.input = 'keyboard'; state.idle = 0; const key = event.key.toLowerCase();\n  if (state.screen === 'attract') { event.preventDefault(); screen('title'); return; }\n  if (event.target instanceof HTMLInputElement && event.target.type === 'text') { if (key === 'enter') { event.preventDefault(); action('create-member'); } return; }\n  if (['arrowup','arrowdown','arrowleft','arrowright',' '].includes(key)) event.preventDefault();\n  keys.add(key); unlockAudio();\n  if (state.screen === 'check' && state.check.phase === 'lean') { const mapping = { a:'left', arrowleft:'left', w:'up', arrowup:'up', d:'right', arrowright:'right', s:'down', arrowdown:'down' }; if (m\napping[key]) state.check.directions.add(mapping[key]); return; }\n  if (state.screen === 'play') { if (key === 'escape') action('pause'); else attemptInput(key); return; }\n  if (key === 'escape' || key === 'backspace') { if (state.screen === 'settings') action('settings-back'); else if (state.screen === 'pause') action('resume'); else if (state.screen === 'about') actio\nn('about-back'); else if (state.screen === 'dev') screen('pause'); else if (state.screen === 'activity') action('island'); else if (state.screen === 'slots' || state.screen === 'class') action('home')\n; return; }\n  if (key === 'arrowdown' || key === 's') focusMove(1); else if (key === 'arrowup' || key === 'w') focusMove(-1); else if ((key === 'enter' || key === ' ') && document.activeElement?.tagName !== 'BUTT\nON') { const buttons = currentButtons(); if (buttons.length) buttons[0].focus(); }\n});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup', event => keys.delete(event.key.toLowerCase()));\nwindow.addEventListener('blur', () => { keys.clear(); if (state.screen === 'play' && !state.hub.active) action('pause'); });\nwindow.addEventListener('mousemove', event => { if (state.screen !== 'play' || event.buttons === 0) return; state.input = 'mouse'; mouseLean = { x: clamp((event.clientX - innerWidth / 2) / (innerHeigh\nt * .33), -1, 1), y: clamp((event.clientY - innerHeight / 2) / (innerHeight * .33), -1, 1) }; });\nwindow.addEventListener('mousedown', event => { if (state.screen === 'play' && event.button === 0) keys.add(' '); });\nwindow.addEventListener('mouseup', () => keys.delete(' '));\nfunction pollGamepad() {\n  const pads = Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.() || []);\n  for (const pad of pads) {\n    if (!pad) continue;\n    const previous = gamepadPrevious[pad.index] || [];\n    pad.buttons.forEach((item, index) => {\n      if (item.pressed && !previous[index]) {\n        state.input = 'gamepad'; state.idle = 0; unlockAudio();\n        if (state.screen === 'attract') screen('title');\n        else if (state.screen === 'play') { if (index === 9) action('pause'); else if (index === 4 || index === 5) attemptInput(index === 4 ? 'q' : 'e'); else if (index === 6 || index === 7) attemptIn\nput(index === 6 ? 'j' : 'k'); }\n        else if (state.screen === 'check' && state.check.phase === 'lean') { if (index === 12) state.check.directions.add('up'); if (index === 13) state.check.directions.add('down'); if (index === 14)\n state.check.directions.add('left'); if (index === 15) state.check.directions.add('right'); }\n        else if (index === 0) { const selected = document.activeElement; if (selected?.tagName === 'BUTTON') selected.click(); else currentButtons()[0]?.focus(); }\n        else if (index === 1) { if (state.screen === 'settings') action('settings-back'); else if (state.screen === 'pause') action('resume'); else if (state.screen === 'about') action('about-back'); \nelse if (!state.hub.active) action('home'); }\n        else if (index === 12) focusMove(-1); else if (index === 13) focusMove(1);\n      }\n    });\n    if (state.screen === 'check' && state.check.phase === 'lean') { if (pad.axes[0] < -.45) state.check.directions.add('left'); if (pad.axes[0] > .45) state.check.directions.add('right'); if (pad.axes\n[1] < -.45) state.check.directions.add('up'); if (pad.axes[1] > .45) state.check.directions.add('down'); }\n    gamepadPrevious[pad.index] = pad.buttons.map(item => item.pressed);\n  }\n}\nconst simulation = new My3D2dge.Game({ headless: true, step: 1 / 120 });\nsimulation.start({ update, draw() {} });\nfunction frame(now) {\n  const dt = lastFrame ? Math.min(.1, (now - lastFrame) / 1000) : 0; lastFrame = now;\n  pollGamepad(); simulation.advance(dt); music(); drawWorld({ ...state, shirt: OUTFITS[person().outfit || 0] });\n  if (now - lastHud > 100) { if (state.screen === 'play') updateHUD(); if (state.screen === 'check') updateCheckHUD(); lastHud = now; }\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n}\nwindow.__ZEN = {\n  state, action, startActivity, tuning,\n  advance(seconds) { simulation.advance(seconds); render(); },\n  snapshot() { return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify({ screen: state.screen, member: state.member, activity: state.activity && { id: state.activity.id, elapsed: state.activity.elapsed, px: state.activity.p\nx, py: state.activity.py, score: state.activity.score, stumbles: state.activity.stumbles }, result: state.result, hub: state.hub, settings: state.settings })); }\n};\nrender(); requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n\nif (state.hub.active) {\n  screen('hub');\n  window.AIHub.on('start', () => { state.hub.started = true; state.hub.startedAt = window.AIHub.time(); startActivity(ACTIVITIES.find(activity => activity.id === 'stork'), { seconds: 60 }); });\n  window.AIHub.on('message', (data, from) => { state.hub.ghosts[from] = data; });\n  window.AIHub.on('time-up', () => { if (!state.hub.finished) { state.hub.finished = true; if (state.activity && state.screen === 'play') state.hub.score += state.activity.score / Math.max(1, state.ac\ntivity.samples) * 1000; window.AIHub.result({ score: Math.round(state.hub.score) }); screen('hub'); } });\n  window.AIHub.on('end', () => { state.hub.finished = true; screen('hub'); });\n  window.AIHub.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true }).then(() => window.AIHub.ready()).catch(() => notify('Unable to connect to the Hub.'));\n}\n\n---ART---\n'use strict';\n\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('world');\nconst context = canvas.getContext('2d');\nlet artWidth = 0;\nlet artHeight = 0;\n\nfunction resizeArt() {\n  const ratio = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\n  artWidth = window.innerWidth;\n  artHeight = window.innerHeight;\n  canvas.width = Math.round(artWidth * ratio);\n  canvas.height = Math.round(artHeight * ratio);\n  context.setTransform(ratio, 0, 0, ratio, 0, 0);\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', resizeArt);\nresizeArt();\n\nfunction ellipse(x, y, rx, ry, color) {\n  context.fillStyle = color;\n  context.beginPath();\n  context.ellipse(x, y, Math.max(.1, rx), Math.max(.1, ry), 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n  context.fill();\n}\nfunction line(x1, y1, x2, y2, width, color) {\n  context.strokeStyle = color;\n  context.lineWidth = width;\n  context.lineCap = 'round';\n  context.beginPath();\n  context.moveTo(x1, y1);\n  context.lineTo(x2, y2);\n  context.stroke();\n}\nfunction rounded(x, y, width, height, radius, color) {\n  context.fillStyle = color;\n  context.beginPath();\n  context.roundRect(x, y, width, height, radius);\n  context.fill();\n}\nfunction drawCloud(x, y, size) {\n  ellipse(x, y, size * 1.4, size * .26, 'rgba(255,255,255,.48)');\n  ellipse(x - size * .45, y - size * .15, size * .55, size * .3, 'rgba(255,255,255,.48)');\n  ellipse(x + size * .25, y - size * .2, size * .65, size * .34, 'rgba(255,255,255,.48)');\n}\nfunction drawTree(x, y, size) {\n  line(x, y, x + size * .03, y - size * .8, size * .11, '#ac8066');\n  ellipse(x, y - size * .79, size * .37, size * .42, '#8ebaa1');\n  ellipse(x - size * .16, y - size * .87, size * .25, size * .3, '#a6ccae');\n}\nfunction drawTare(x, y, size, mood) {\n  ellipse(x, y + size * .12, size * .58, size * .13, 'rgba(50,90,80,.13)');\n  rounded(x - size * .47, y - size * .37, size * .94, size * .48, size * .13, '#e4ede8');\n  rounded(x - size * .47, y - size * .43, size * .94, size * .48, size * .13, '#fffefa');\n  rounded(x - size * .22, y - size * .31, size * .44, size * .2, size * .05, '#d9efdf');\n  ellipse(x - size * .08, y - size * .23, size * .025, size * .027, '#416b60');\n  ellipse(x + size * .08, y - size * .23, size * .025, size * .027, '#416b60');\n  context.strokeStyle = '#416b60'; context.lineWidth = Math.max(1, size * .015); context.beginPath();\n  context.arc(x, y - size * .2, size * .045, .2, Math.PI - .2); context.stroke();\n  if (mood) { context.fillStyle = '#e6ad65'; context.font = `bold ${size * .2}px sans-serif`; context.fillText('✦', x + size * .57, y - size * .46); }\n}\nfunction drawPerson(x, ground, size, options = {}) {\n  const sway = (options.lean || 0) * size * .13 + Math.sin((options.time || 0) * 1.3) * size * .008;\n  const movement = options.movement || 0;\n  const skin = options.skin || '#e8b69b';\n  const shirt = options.shirt || '#f1c86c';\n  const trousers = options.trousers || '#527d75';\n  ellipse(x, ground + size * .035, size * .39, size * .065, 'rgba(56,95,80,.13)');\n  line(x - size * .1, ground - size * .31, x - size * (.16 + movement * .08), ground - size * .03, size * .105, trousers);\n  line(x + size * .1, ground - size * .31, x + size * (.16 - movement * .08), ground - size * .03, size * .105, trousers);\n  line(x - size * (.16 + movement * .08), ground - size * .03, x - size * (.23 + movement * .08), ground - size * .03, size * .07, '#f9f8e9');\n  line(x + size * (.16 - movement * .08), ground - size * .03, x + size * (.23 - movement * .08), ground - size * .03, size * .07, '#f9f8e9');\n  line(x - size * .13 + sway, ground - size * .6, x - size * .35 + sway, ground - size * (.49 + Math.abs(movement) * .12), size * .08, skin);\n  line(x + size * .13 + sway, ground - size * .6, x + size * .35 + sway, ground - size * (.49 - Math.abs(movement) * .12), size * .08, skin);\n  rounded(x - size * .19 + sway, ground - size * .68, size * .38, size * .4, size * .12, shirt);\n  line(x + sway, ground - size * .71, x + sway, ground - size * .65, size * .105, skin);\n  ellipse(x + sway, ground - size * .85, size * .19, size * .22, skin);\n  ellipse(x + sway, ground - size * .99, size * .19, size * .105, '#52655a');\n  ellipse(x - size * .065 + sway, ground - size * .85, size * .013, size * .016, '#496156');\n  ellipse(x + size * .065 + sway, ground - size * .85, size * .013, size * .016, '#496156');\n  context.strokeStyle = '#a56d61'; context.lineWidth = Math.max(1, size * .012); context.beginPath();\n  context.arc(x + sway, ground - size * .81, size * .045, .1, Math.PI - .1); context.stroke();\n}\nfunction drawScenery(time) {\n  const width = artWidth, height = artHeight;\n  const sky = context.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, height);\n  sky.addColorStop(0, '#e3f4ef'); sky.addColorStop(.55, '#eff8e9'); sky.addColorStop(1, '#bfe3d3');\n  context.fillStyle = sky; context.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n  ellipse(width * .77, height * .19, Math.min(width, height) * .11, Math.min(width, height) * .11, '#fae9b5');\n  drawCloud(width * .67 + Math.sin(time * .08) * 9, height * .15, width * .08);\n  drawCloud(width * .92, height * .27, width * .05);\n  context.fillStyle = '#c9e7d7'; context.beginPath(); context.moveTo(0, height * .64); context.quadraticCurveTo(width * .24, height * .31, width * .45, height * .61); context.quadraticCurveTo(width * \n.67, height * .36, width, height * .63); context.lineTo(width, height); context.lineTo(0, height); context.fill();\n  context.fillStyle = '#aedbc9'; context.beginPath(); context.moveTo(0, height * .69); context.quadraticCurveTo(width * .21, height * .51, width * .44, height * .68); context.quadraticCurveTo(width * \n.72, height * .46, width, height * .65); context.lineTo(width, height); context.lineTo(0, height); context.fill();\n  context.fillStyle = '#cdebe0'; context.fillRect(0, height * .7, width, height * .3);\n  for (let index = 0; index < 11; index++) {\n    const rippleX = ((index * 191 + time * 5) % (width + 100)) - 50;\n    line(rippleX, height * (.74 + (index % 4) * .045), rippleX + 42 + index * 3, height * (.74 + (index % 4) * .045), 2, 'rgba(255,255,255,.35)');\n  }\n}\nfunction drawWorld(state) {\n  const width = artWidth, height = artHeight, time = state.clock || 0;\n  context.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n  drawScenery(time);\n  const compact = width < 700;\n  const active = state.screen === 'play' || state.screen === 'check';\n  const cx = compact ? width * .52 : active ? width * .5 : width * .73;\n  const cy = active ? height * .76 : compact ? height * .46 : height * .68;\n  const size = Math.min(width * (compact ? .63 : .30), height * .52);\n  ellipse(cx, cy + size * .19, size * 1.05, size * .28, '#a9cfb5');\n  ellipse(cx, cy + size * .13, size, size * .26, '#d5e7c4');\n  ellipse(cx, cy + size * .07, size * .91, size * .2, '#e9efd4');\n  drawTree(cx - size * .7, cy - size * .1, size * .42);\n  drawTree(cx + size * .72, cy - size * .08, size * .3);\n  if (!active) {\n    rounded(cx - size * .37, cy - size * .39, size * .53, size * .32, size * .025, '#fff9e9');\n    context.fillStyle = '#dfaa88'; context.beginPath(); context.moveTo(cx - size * .43, cy - size * .39); context.lineTo(cx - size * .11, cy - size * .58); context.lineTo(cx + size * .21, cy - size * \n.39); context.closePath(); context.fill();\n    rounded(cx - size * .12, cy - size * .29, size * .11, size * .2, size * .012, '#9ec6b2');\n    rounded(cx - size * .31, cy - size * .29, size * .12, size * .1, size * .01, '#b4ddd2');\n    ellipse(cx + size * .28, cy + size * .02, size * .31, size * .09, '#a4cfc1');\n    drawPerson(cx + size * .27, cy, size * .6, { time, movement: Math.sin(time * 1.2) * .2 });\n    drawTare(cx + size * .58, cy + size * .08, size * .24, true);\n    for (let index = 0; index < 5; index++) ellipse(cx - size * .6 + index * size * .07, cy + size * .12, 3, 3, index % 2 ? '#f6c888' : '#fff8e5');\n  } else {\n    const activity = state.activity;\n    const lean = activity ? activity.px : 0;\n    const movement = activity ? Math.sin(activity.elapsed * (activity.kind === 'jog' ? 5 : 2)) * .6 : 0;\n    ellipse(cx, cy + size * .05, size * .55, size * .12, '#a5d2bf');\n    drawPerson(cx, cy, size * .95, { time, lean, movement, shirt: state.shirt });\n    drawTare(cx + size * .55, cy + size * .06, size * .22, false);\n    if (activity && activity.kind === 'candle') {\n      rounded(cx - size * .65, cy - size * .14, size * .11, size * .16, 4, '#fffaf0');\n      ellipse(cx - size * .595, cy - size * .16, size * .035, size * (.055 + activity.flame * .06), '#f7c05b');\n    }\n    if (activity && activity.kind === 'hoop') {\n      context.strokeStyle = '#f5ae80'; context.lineWidth = size * .035; context.beginPath(); context.ellipse(cx, cy - size * .35, size * .36, size * .09, -.08, 0, Math.PI * 2); context.stroke();\n    }\n    if (activity && activity.kind === 'tray') {\n      line(cx - size * .38, cy - size * .49, cx + size * .38, cy - size * .49 + lean * size * .1, size * .045, '#bb8b6d');\n      ellipse(cx, cy - size * .52, size * .06, size * .035, '#849e67');\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n---DATA---\n'use strict';\n\nconst GROUPS = {\n  stillness: { name: 'Stillness', color: '#8dc4ad', light: '#e2f2e9', icon: '✳', description: 'A little room to breathe.' },\n  strength: { name: 'Strength', color: '#e8ad8d', light: '#fceadf', icon: '✦', description: 'Find strength without the shouting.' },\n  cardio: { name: 'Cardio', color: '#efc76f', light: '#fff3d1', icon: '♪', description: 'Move to your own very good beat.' },\n  balance: { name: 'Balance', color: '#9fbde0', light: '#e9f1fc', icon: '◇', description: 'A gentle negotiation with gravity.' }\n};\n\nconst ACTIVITIES = [\n  { id: 'stork', name: 'Stork Stand', group: 'stillness', day: 1, seconds: 45, kind: 'hold', icon: '✳', tagline: 'One leg. Many feelings.', instruction: 'Guide your dot into the moving ring and hold it there. Watch out for the gull.', clip: 'standing' },\n  { id: 'sun', name: 'Sun Flow', group: 'stillness', day: 2, seconds: 80, kind: 'breath', icon: '☼', tagline: 'Five poses, one lovely breath.', instruction: 'Stay centered. Hold Space or a trigger as the circle grows; release as it shrinks.', clip: 'yoga' },\n  { id: 'candle', name: 'Quiet Candle', group: 'stillness', day: 3, seconds: 60, kind: 'candle', icon: '♨', tagline: 'Out-still a candle.', instruction: 'Keep your dot steady to help the flame grow. Settle back into the ring to relight it.', clip: 'standing' },\n  { id: 'squat', name: 'Squat Rail', group: 'strength', day: 1, seconds: 60, kind: 'rep', icon: '↕', tagline: 'Down to earth, back again.', instruction: 'Hold Space or a trigger to lower on the beat. Release to rise, and stay balanced.', clip: 'squat' },\n  { id: 'push', name: 'Push-Up', group: 'strength', day: 2, seconds: 60, kind: 'rep', icon: '≋', tagline: 'The floor is very supportive.', instruction: 'Hold Space or a trigger to lower on the beat. Release to press up.', clip: 'pushup' },\n  { id: 'lunge', name: 'Side Lunge', group: 'strength', day: 3, seconds: 60, kind: 'rep', icon: '↔', tagline: 'A step in the right direction. Or left.', instruction: 'Lean toward the highlighted side and hold Space on the beat, then release.', clip: 'lunge' },\n  { id: 'step', name: 'Step Class', group: 'cardio', day: 1, seconds: 60, kind: 'step', icon: '♪', tagline: 'Meet the beat where it is.', instruction: 'Press the arrow or WASD matching each arriving arrow. A good rhythm is better than a perfect one.', clip: 'walk' },\n  { id: 'hoop', name: 'Hoop Hips', group: 'cardio', day: 2, seconds: 60, kind: 'hoop', icon: '◎', tagline: 'A well-rounded workout.', instruction: 'Circle your lean to spin the hoop. Tap Q or E to catch a hoop tossed from that side.', clip: 'standing' },\n  { id: 'jog', name: 'Coastal Jog', group: 'cardio', day: 3, seconds: 70, kind: 'jog', icon: '➜', tagline: 'The scenic route is the point.', instruction: 'Alternate J and K, or the triggers, to jog. Lean to steer around the cups.', clip: 'run' },\n  { id: 'slalom', name: 'Slalom', group: 'balance', day: 3, seconds: 60, kind: 'slalom', icon: '⚑', tagline: 'A very polite downhill.', instruction: 'Lean left or right through the gates. Lean forward to speed up, back to slow down.', clip: 'standing' },\n  { id: 'tray', name: 'Tray Service', group: 'balance', day: 1, seconds: 60, kind: 'tray', icon: '◌', tagline: 'Keep your olives to yourself.', instruction: 'Keep the tray level as you walk. The olives would prefer not to become airborne.', clip: 'walk' },\n  { id: 'laundry', name: 'Laundry Line', group: 'balance', day: 2, seconds: 60, kind: 'rope', icon: '⌁', tagline: 'A fine line between socks.', instruction: 'Balance over the line, lean forward to walk, and collect the fluttering pegs.', clip: 'walk' }\n];\n\nconst DAY_INTROS = [\n  'Welcome to the Institute for Gentle Improvement. We have been expecting you, in a very relaxed way.',\n  'A new morning. The island has prepared absolutely no urgent emails.',\n  'The sea is calm. Dennis is less calm, but is working on it.',\n  'You have made space for yourself. The advanced mats have made space for you.',\n  'It is the Gentle Games! Participation is mandatory only for the gulls.'\n];\n\nconst CAST = [\n  ['Gertrude', 'I used to be competitive. Now I am competitively relaxed.'],\n  ['Dennis', 'I brought a towel in case of a personal breakthrough.'],\n  ['Marisol', 'A wobble is just your body writing in cursive.'],\n  ['Young Kevin', 'I am called Young Kevin because the other Kevin has tenure.']\n];\n\nconst COLORS = ['#d98a68', '#e8b28d', '#8c573f', '#f1ccad', '#b87956', '#704638'];\nconst OUTFITS = ['#e98d78', '#79b9ac', '#e7b961', '#9b9dd1', '#638ca5', '#d77f9c'];\nconst clamp = (number, min, max) => Math.max(min, Math.min(max, number));\nconst escapeHTML = value => String(value).replace(/[&<>\"']/g, character => ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '\"': '&quot;', \"'\": '&#39;' })[character]);\n\nfunction seeded(seed) {\n  let state = seed >>> 0 || 1;\n  return () => { state ^= state << 13; state ^= state >>> 17; state ^= state << 5; return (state >>> 0) / 4294967296; };\n}\n\n---STATUS---\n# Progress\n\n## Handoff\n- Game title: Wee Bit of Zen\n- Deliverable basename: `Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356`\n- Build a complete, single-file game from `PLAN.md` and follow `TASK.md` for the handoff.\n\n## Status\n- [x] Read the task and begin extracting the game design.\n- [x] Fetch the required engine, mocap clips, and AI Hub client and harness.\n- [x] Integrate the fixed-step engine and load the AI Hub client.\n- [x] Implement the island, 12 activities, story, saves, settings, and initial class mode.\n- [x] Produce the first self-contained HTML and a provisional structured exit interview.\n- [ ] Finish real multiplayer scoring, the three-event AI Hub session, and motion integration.\n- [ ] Exercise the game and inspect responsive, cross-browser screenshots; finalize the interview.\n\n## Notes\n- Keep all project work inside this run's workspace; do not inspect sibling runs.\n- Use Playwright's WebKit as the available approximation of iOS Safari.\n- The original handoff, motion sources, and hub client are in the development folder; `vendor/fitclips.js` is the generated local clip set.\n- Build with `node 'Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/build.mjs'`; this also copies the standalone build into the Hub harness.\n- A local preview is running at `http://127.0.0.1:32893/` in exec session `68330`; stop only that session when finished.\n- The first Chromium smoke test opened the standalone successfully. Title spacing, authentic class scoring, Hub sequencing, and applying the downloaded motion clips remain under review.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
