{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_218","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; sed -n '1,180p' PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- class setup ---\\\\n'; sed -n '105,145p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 180; printf '\"'\\\\n--- actions ---\\\\n'; sed -n '180,240p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 180; printf '\"'\\\\n--- frame ---\\\\n'; sed -n '295,380p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 180; printf '\"'\\\\n--- art ---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,180p' \\\"\"'$D/src/art.js\" | fold -w 180'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_218","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; sed -n '1,180p' PROGRESS.md; printf '\\\\n--- class setup ---\\\\n'; sed -n '105,145p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 180; printf '\"'\\\\n--- actions ---\\\\n'; sed -n '180,240p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 180; printf '\"'\\\\n--- frame ---\\\\n'; sed -n '295,380p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 180; printf '\"'\\\\n--- art ---\\\\n'; sed -n '1,180p' \\\"\"'$D/src/art.js\" | fold -w 180'","aggregated_output":"# Progress\n\n## Handoff\n- Game title: Wee Bit of Zen\n- Deliverable basename: `Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356`\n- Build a complete, single-file game from `PLAN.md` and follow `TASK.md` for the handoff.\n\n## Status\n- [x] Read the task and begin extracting the game design.\n- [x] Fetch the required engine, mocap clips, and AI Hub client and harness.\n- [x] Integrate the fixed-step engine and load the AI Hub client.\n- [x] Implement the island, 12 activities, story, saves, settings, and initial class mode.\n- [x] Produce the first self-contained HTML and a provisional structured exit interview.\n- [ ] Finish real multiplayer scoring, the three-event AI Hub session, and motion integration.\n- [ ] Exercise the game and inspect responsive, cross-browser screenshots; finalize the interview.\n\n## Notes\n- Keep all project work inside this run's workspace; do not inspect sibling runs.\n- Use Playwright's WebKit as the available approximation of iOS Safari.\n- The original handoff, motion sources, and hub client are in the development folder; `vendor/fitclips.js` is the generated local clip set.\n- Build with `node 'Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/build.mjs'`; this also copies the standalone build into the Hub harness.\n- A local preview is running at `http://127.0.0.1:32893/` in exec session `68330`; stop only that session when finished.\n- The first Chromium smoke test opened the standalone successfully. Title spacing, authentic class scoring, Hub sequencing, and applying the downloaded motion clips remain under review.\n\n--- class setup ---\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue result-card\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; PRACTICE COMPLETE</div><div class=\"stars-big\">${'★'.repeat(result\n.stars)}<span>${'☆'.repeat(3 - result.stars)}</span></div><h1>Lovely work${state.classMode ? ', everyone' : ''}.</h1><p>“${result.message}”</p><div class=\"result-stats\"><div><stron\ng>${result.percent}%</strong><small>STEADINESS</small></div><div><strong>+${result.minutes}</strong><small>FIT MINUTES</small></div><div><strong>${result.stumbles}</strong><small>W\nOBBLES</small></div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Practice again', 'retry')}${button(state.festival ? 'Continue the Games' : state.classMode ? 'Class results' : 'Back to isl\nand', 'result-continue', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'recap') {\n    heading = 'DAY COMPLETE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ANOTHER DAY WELL SPENT</div><h1>Rest is part of it.</h1><p>“${member.sessions\n} sessions today. Gerald the ceramic hippo has made a careful note.”</p><div class=\"result-stats\"><div><strong>${Math.floor(member.minutes)}</strong><small>FIT MINUTES</small></div\n><div><strong>${Object.keys(member.stars || {}).length}</strong><small>MATS VISITED</small></div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Wake up to day ' + (member.day + 1), 'next-day\n', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'festival') {\n    heading = 'DAY 5 &nbsp; / &nbsp; GENTLE GAMES';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THE GENTLE GAMES</div><h1>Ready, steady,<br><em>be yourself.</em></h1><p>Thre\ne friendly challenges, ending in the Grand Stillness with Gertrude. The prize is a very nice feeling.</p><p class=\"note\">Challenge ${state.festivalIndex + 1} of 3 &nbsp; · &nbsp; $\n{['Stork Stand', 'Slalom', 'Quiet Candle'][state.festivalIndex]}</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Begin challenge', 'festival-start', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'ending') {\n    heading = 'THANK YOU FOR STAYING';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; YOUR ISLAND IS ALWAYS HERE</div><div class=\"stars-big\">✳</div><h1>A little st\neadier.<br><em>A lot more you.</em></h1><p>Gertrude awards you the Golden Composure. Dennis is emotional. Tare insists the award is calibrated.</p><p class=\"note\">Thank you for fiv\ne days of moving, breathing, and making room. The mats are yours whenever you wish.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Explore freely', 'free-play', true)}${button('About & credits'\n, 'about')}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'class') {\n    heading = 'LOCAL CLASS';\n    const players = state.classPlayers;\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; BETTER TOGETHER</div><h1>Make room for friends.</h1><p>Up to four share the same\n screen. One keyboard player; connect controllers for more.</p></div></div><div class=\"class-players\">${[0, 1, 2, 3].map((index) => `<div class=\"card player-tile\"><span class=\"slot\n-avatar\">${players[index] ? '☺' : '+'}</span><strong>${players[index] ? escapeHTML(players[index].name) : 'Open spot'}</strong><small>${players[index] ? escapeHTML(players[index].t\nype) : 'Join or add a bot'}</small><button class=\"chip\" data-action=\"class-toggle\" data-id=\"${index}\">${players[index] ? 'REMOVE' : 'ADD BOT'}</button></div>`).join('')}</div><div \nclass=\"card class-select\"><p>CHOOSE A CLASS</p><div class=\"options\">${['stork','candle','step','slalom','tray'].map(id => `<button class=\"option ${state.selection?.id === id ? 'sel\nected' : ''}\" data-action=\"class-activity\" data-id=\"${id}\">${ACTIVITIES.find(a => a.id === id).name}</button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', member.na\nme === 'Guest' ? 'home' : 'island')}${button('Start class', 'start-class', true)}</div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'class-result') {\n    heading = 'LOCAL CLASS';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; EVERYONE SHOWED UP</div><h1>A class act.</h1><p>Everyone gets their own kind \nof gold star.</p>${state.classPlayers.map((player, index) => `<div class=\"row\"><span>${escapeHTML(player.name)} ${player.type === 'Bot' ? '· BOT' : ''}</span><b>${Math.max(30, stat\ne.result.percent - index * 5)} points &nbsp; ★</b></div>`).join('')}<div class=\"actions\">${button('Back to class', 'class', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'settings') {\n    heading = 'SETTINGS';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; MAKE YOURSELF COMFORTABLE</div><h1>Your settings.</h1></div></div><div cl\nass=\"card settings-card\">${settingRow('Music', state.settings.music + '%', 'volume', 'music')}${settingRow('Sound effects', state.settings.sound + '%', 'volume', 'sound')}${setting\nRow('Voice sounds', state.settings.voice ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'voice')}${settingRow('Gentle mode', state.settings.gentle ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'gentle')}${settingRow('Brea\nthing', state.settings.breathToggle ? 'TOGGLE' : 'HOLD', 'toggle', 'breathToggle')}${settingRow('Tips', state.settings.tips ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'tips')}${settingRow('Controll\ner symbols', state.settings.glyphs.toUpperCase(), 'glyphs')}<p class=\"note\">Select a volume to cycle from 0% to 100%. Gentle mode makes balancing more forgiving.</p><div class=\"act\nions\">${button('Done', 'settings-back', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'pause') {\n    heading = 'PAUSED';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; TAKE YOUR TIME</div><h1>Pause is a practice, too.</h1><div class=\"menu-stack\"\n>${button('Resume', 'resume', true)}${button('Restart session', 'restart')}${button('Settings', 'settings')}${state.hub.active ? '' : button('Developer mode', 'dev')}${state.hub.ac\ntive ? '' : button('Leave session', 'leave-play')}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'dev') {\n    heading = 'DEVELOPER MODE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card settings-card\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; LIVE TUNING</div><h1>Behind the wobble.</h1>${[['spring','Spring',4,20,.\n5],['damping','Damping',1,12,.5],['instability','Instability',0,4,.1],['noise','Disturbance',0,.8,.05]].map(([key, name, min, max, step]) => `<label class=\"slider\">${name} <output \nid=\"out-${key}\">${tuning[key]}</output><input type=\"range\" data-tuning=\"${key}\" min=\"${min}\" max=\"${max}\" step=\"${step}\" value=\"${tuning[key]}\"></label>`).join('')}<div class=\"acti\nons\">${button('Reset tuning', 'reset-tuning')}${button('Back to pause', 'pause', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'about') {\n    heading = 'ABOUT & CREDITS';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card scroll\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; A LITTLE NOTE FROM THE MAKERS</div><h1>About & credits.</h1><p>Made with care f\nor everyone who has ever wobbled.</p>${aboutContent()}<div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', 'about-back', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'hub') {\n    heading = 'AI HUB &nbsp; / &nbsp; GHOST CLASS';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THREE MINUTES TOGETHER</div><h1>${state.hub.finished ? 'Class complete.' : 'A\n little steadiness, shared.'}</h1><p>${state.hub.finished ? 'Your result has been sent to the Hub.' : 'Stork Stand, Step Class, and Quiet Candle. The steadiest practice wins; every\none gets a moment to breathe.'}</p><div class=\"result-stats\"><div><strong>${Math.round(state.hub.score)}</strong><small>POINTS</small></div></div><p class=\"note\">${state.hub.starte\nd ? 'The class is underway.' : 'Waiting for the other guests…'}</p></div></main>`;\n  }\n  app.innerHTML = shell(content, heading, state.screen !== 'play' && state.screen !== 'check');\n  if (state.screen === 'play') updateHUD();\n  if (state.screen === 'check') updateCheckHUD();\n  const touchOnly = matchMedia('(pointer: coarse)').matches && !Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.() || []).some(Boolean);\n  if (touchOnly && !['settings','about'].includes(state.screen)) {\n    const notice = document.createElement('div'); notice.className = 'touch-notice'; notice.innerHTML = '<div><span>✳</span><h2>Controller or keyboard required</h2><p>Connect a con\ntroller or keyboard to enjoy the island.</p><button class=\"action primary\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button></div>'; app.appendChild(notice);\n  }\n}\n\n--- actions ---\n  if ((key === ' ' || key === 'enter') && state.settings.breathToggle) toggledBreath = !toggledBreath;\n}\nconst tuningDefaults = { spring: 11, damping: 6, instability: 1.3, noise: .19 };\nconst tuning = { ...tuningDefaults };\nfunction updateActivity(dt) {\n  const activity = state.activity; if (!activity) return;\n  activity.elapsed += dt;\n  const pad = Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.() || []).find(Boolean), axisX = pad && Math.abs(pad.axes[0]) > .12 ? pad.axes[0] : 0, axisY = pad && Math.abs(pad.axes[1]) > .12 ? \npad.axes[1] : 0;\n  const dx = (keys.has('arrowright') || keys.has('d') ? 1 : 0) - (keys.has('arrowleft') || keys.has('a') ? 1 : 0);\n  const dy = (keys.has('arrowdown') || keys.has('s') ? 1 : 0) - (keys.has('arrowup') || keys.has('w') ? 1 : 0);\n  if (activity.stun <= 0) {\n    if (mouseLean) { activity.ux = mouseLean.x; activity.uy = mouseLean.y; }\n    else if (axisX || axisY) { activity.ux = axisX; activity.uy = axisY; }\n    else { activity.ux = clamp(activity.ux + dx * 2.2 * dt, -1, 1); activity.uy = clamp(activity.uy + dy * 2.2 * dt, -1, 1); if (!dx) activity.ux *= Math.max(0, 1 - .5 * dt); if (!\ndy) activity.uy *= Math.max(0, 1 - .5 * dt); }\n  } else activity.stun -= dt;\n  const gentle = state.settings.gentle ? .7 : 1, time = activity.elapsed, disturbance = tuning.noise * gentle;\n  const ax = tuning.spring * (activity.ux - activity.px) - tuning.damping * activity.vx + tuning.instability * gentle * activity.px + disturbance * (Math.sin(time * 1.7) + .5 * Mat\nh.sin(time * 3.23));\n  const ay = tuning.spring * (activity.uy - activity.py) - tuning.damping * activity.vy + tuning.instability * gentle * activity.py + disturbance * (Math.sin(time * 1.19 + 1) + .5 \n* Math.sin(time * 2.71));\n  activity.vx += ax * dt; activity.vy += ay * dt; activity.px += activity.vx * dt; activity.py += activity.vy * dt;\n  if (Math.hypot(activity.px, activity.py) >= 1 && activity.stun <= 0) { activity.stumbles++; activity.stun = 1; activity.px *= .5; activity.py *= .5; activity.vx *= -.2; activity.\nvy *= -.2; tone(196, .18); }\n  const phase = Math.floor(time / 12), rng = seeded(phase * 667 + 43);\n  activity.ringX = activity.id === 'stork' ? (rng() - .5) * .65 : activity.kind === 'slalom' ? Math.sin(time * .55) * .46 : 0;\n  activity.ringY = activity.id === 'stork' ? (rng() - .5) * .35 : 0;\n  const distance = Math.hypot(activity.px - activity.ringX, activity.py - activity.ringY), ringSize = state.settings.gentle ? .48 : .38;\n  const steadiness = clamp(1 - distance * 1.4, 0, 1);\n  let quality = steadiness;\n  const held = state.settings.breathToggle ? toggledBreath : keys.has(' ') || !!pad?.buttons[7]?.pressed;\n  activity.effort = clamp(activity.effort + (held ? 1 : -1) * dt / 4, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'rep') { const goal = (Math.sin(time * Math.PI / 2 - Math.PI / 2) + 1) / 2; quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.effort - goal), 0, 1) * steadiness; activi\nty.reps = Math.floor(time / 4); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'breath') { const inhale = Math.sin(time * Math.PI / 4) > 0; quality = steadiness * (held === inhale ? 1 : .5); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'step') quality = clamp(activity.beatHits / Math.max(1, time * 100 / 60) * 1.5, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'hoop') { activity.motions += (Math.abs(activity.vx) + Math.abs(activity.vy)) * dt; quality = clamp(activity.motions / Math.max(1, time) * 3 + activity.hoop\nHits / Math.max(1, time / 10), 0, 1); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'jog') quality = clamp(activity.jogHits / Math.max(1, time * 2) * 1.5, 0, 1) * steadiness;\n  if (activity.kind === 'slalom') quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.px - activity.ringX) * 1.5, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'tray') { activity.tray += (activity.px - activity.tray) * dt * 1.5; quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.tray) * 2, 0, 1); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'rope') quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.px) * 2, 0, 1) * (activity.uy < -.1 ? 1 : .65);\n  if (activity.kind === 'candle') { activity.flame = clamp(activity.flame + (distance < ringSize ? .13 : -.3) * dt, 0, 1); quality = activity.flame; }\n  activity.score += quality; activity.samples++;\n  if (state.hub.active) {\n    const now = window.AIHub.time();\n    if (now - state.hub.lastSend >= 100) { state.hub.lastSend = now; window.AIHub.send({ x: activity.px, y: activity.py, exercise: activity.id }); }\n    if (now - state.hub.lastProgress >= 1000) { state.hub.lastProgress = now; window.AIHub.progress({ score: Math.round(state.hub.score + activity.score / Math.max(1, activity.samp\nles) * 1000), label: activity.name }); }\n  }\n  if (activity.elapsed >= activity.seconds) completeActivity();\n}\nfunction updateHUD() {\n  const activity = state.activity; if (!activity) return;\n  const timer = document.getElementById('play-timer'), status = document.getElementById('play-status'), instruction = document.getElementById('play-instruction'), progress = docume\nnt.getElementById('play-progress'), dot = document.getElementById('plate-dot'), ring = document.getElementById('plate-ring'), score = document.getElementById('play-score');\n  if (!timer) return;\n  timer.textContent = Math.max(0, Math.ceil(activity.seconds - activity.elapsed));\n  if (activity.kind === 'step') { const arrows = ['←','↑','→','↓']; const beat = Math.round(activity.elapsed * 100 / 60); status.textContent = `NEXT STEP  ${arrows[(beat + 4) % 4]}\n   ·   ${activity.beatHits} on beat`; instruction.textContent = `Press ${arrows[(beat + 4) % 4]} on the beat · ${activity.instruction}`; }\n  else if (activity.kind === 'rep') status.textContent = `Rep ${activity.reps + 1} · ${Math.sin(activity.elapsed * Math.PI / 2 - Math.PI / 2) > 0 ? 'Rise gently' : 'Lower gently'}`\n;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'breath') status.textContent = Math.sin(activity.elapsed * Math.PI / 4) > 0 ? 'Breathe in · hold' : 'Breathe out · release';\n  else if (activity.kind === 'candle') status.textContent = `Flame ${Math.round(activity.flame * 100)}% · ${activity.flame < .15 ? 'settle to relight' : 'let it glow'}`;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'jog') status.textContent = `${activity.jogHits} steps · alternate J and K`;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'hoop') status.textContent = `${activity.hoopHits} catches · circle your lean`;\n  else status.textContent = activity.stun > 0 ? 'A wobble! Take a moment.' : 'Find the ring. Breathe naturally.';\n  progress.style.width = `${clamp(activity.elapsed / activity.seconds * 100, 0, 100)}%`;\n  dot.style.transform = `translate(${activity.px * 70}px, ${activity.py * 70}px)`;\n  ring.style.transform = `translate(${activity.ringX * 70}px, ${activity.ringY * 70}px)`;\n  score.textContent = `${Math.round(activity.score / Math.max(1, activity.samples) * 100)}% STEADY`;\n\n--- frame ---\n  }\n}\napp.addEventListener('click', event => { const target = event.target.closest('[data-action]'); if (target) action(target.dataset.action, target.dataset.id); });\napp.addEventListener('mouseover', event => { const target = event.target.closest('button'); if (target && state.input !== 'gamepad') target.focus({ preventScroll: true }); });\napp.addEventListener('input', event => { const key = event.target.dataset.tuning; if (key) { tuning[key] = Number(event.target.value); document.getElementById(`out-${key}`).value =\n tuning[key]; } });\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown', event => {\n  if (event.repeat && event.key !== ' ') return;\n  state.input = 'keyboard'; state.idle = 0; const key = event.key.toLowerCase();\n  if (state.screen === 'attract') { event.preventDefault(); screen('title'); return; }\n  if (event.target instanceof HTMLInputElement && event.target.type === 'text') { if (key === 'enter') { event.preventDefault(); action('create-member'); } return; }\n  if (['arrowup','arrowdown','arrowleft','arrowright',' '].includes(key)) event.preventDefault();\n  keys.add(key); unlockAudio();\n  if (state.screen === 'check' && state.check.phase === 'lean') { const mapping = { a:'left', arrowleft:'left', w:'up', arrowup:'up', d:'right', arrowright:'right', s:'down', arrow\ndown:'down' }; if (mapping[key]) state.check.directions.add(mapping[key]); return; }\n  if (state.screen === 'play') { if (key === 'escape') action('pause'); else attemptInput(key); return; }\n  if (key === 'escape' || key === 'backspace') { if (state.screen === 'settings') action('settings-back'); else if (state.screen === 'pause') action('resume'); else if (state.scree\nn === 'about') action('about-back'); else if (state.screen === 'dev') screen('pause'); else if (state.screen === 'activity') action('island'); else if (state.screen === 'slots' || \nstate.screen === 'class') action('home'); return; }\n  if (key === 'arrowdown' || key === 's') focusMove(1); else if (key === 'arrowup' || key === 'w') focusMove(-1); else if ((key === 'enter' || key === ' ') && document.activeElemen\nt?.tagName !== 'BUTTON') { const buttons = currentButtons(); if (buttons.length) buttons[0].focus(); }\n});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup', event => keys.delete(event.key.toLowerCase()));\nwindow.addEventListener('blur', () => { keys.clear(); if (state.screen === 'play' && !state.hub.active) action('pause'); });\nwindow.addEventListener('mousemove', event => { if (state.screen !== 'play' || event.buttons === 0) return; state.input = 'mouse'; mouseLean = { x: clamp((event.clientX - innerWidt\nh / 2) / (innerHeight * .33), -1, 1), y: clamp((event.clientY - innerHeight / 2) / (innerHeight * .33), -1, 1) }; });\nwindow.addEventListener('mousedown', event => { if (state.screen === 'play' && event.button === 0) keys.add(' '); });\nwindow.addEventListener('mouseup', () => keys.delete(' '));\nfunction pollGamepad() {\n  const pads = Array.from(navigator.getGamepads?.() || []);\n  for (const pad of pads) {\n    if (!pad) continue;\n    const previous = gamepadPrevious[pad.index] || [];\n    pad.buttons.forEach((item, index) => {\n      if (item.pressed && !previous[index]) {\n        state.input = 'gamepad'; state.idle = 0; unlockAudio();\n        if (state.screen === 'attract') screen('title');\n        else if (state.screen === 'play') { if (index === 9) action('pause'); else if (index === 4 || index === 5) attemptInput(index === 4 ? 'q' : 'e'); else if (index === 6 || in\ndex === 7) attemptInput(index === 6 ? 'j' : 'k'); }\n        else if (state.screen === 'check' && state.check.phase === 'lean') { if (index === 12) state.check.directions.add('up'); if (index === 13) state.check.directions.add('down'\n); if (index === 14) state.check.directions.add('left'); if (index === 15) state.check.directions.add('right'); }\n        else if (index === 0) { const selected = document.activeElement; if (selected?.tagName === 'BUTTON') selected.click(); else currentButtons()[0]?.focus(); }\n        else if (index === 1) { if (state.screen === 'settings') action('settings-back'); else if (state.screen === 'pause') action('resume'); else if (state.screen === 'about') ac\ntion('about-back'); else if (!state.hub.active) action('home'); }\n        else if (index === 12) focusMove(-1); else if (index === 13) focusMove(1);\n      }\n    });\n    if (state.screen === 'check' && state.check.phase === 'lean') { if (pad.axes[0] < -.45) state.check.directions.add('left'); if (pad.axes[0] > .45) state.check.directions.add('r\night'); if (pad.axes[1] < -.45) state.check.directions.add('up'); if (pad.axes[1] > .45) state.check.directions.add('down'); }\n    gamepadPrevious[pad.index] = pad.buttons.map(item => item.pressed);\n  }\n}\nconst simulation = new My3D2dge.Game({ headless: true, step: 1 / 120 });\nsimulation.start({ update, draw() {} });\nfunction frame(now) {\n  const dt = lastFrame ? Math.min(.1, (now - lastFrame) / 1000) : 0; lastFrame = now;\n  pollGamepad(); simulation.advance(dt); music(); drawWorld({ ...state, shirt: OUTFITS[person().outfit || 0] });\n  if (now - lastHud > 100) { if (state.screen === 'play') updateHUD(); if (state.screen === 'check') updateCheckHUD(); lastHud = now; }\n  requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n}\nwindow.__ZEN = {\n  state, action, startActivity, tuning,\n  advance(seconds) { simulation.advance(seconds); render(); },\n  snapshot() { return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify({ screen: state.screen, member: state.member, activity: state.activity && { id: state.activity.id, elapsed: state.activity.elapsed, \npx: state.activity.px, py: state.activity.py, score: state.activity.score, stumbles: state.activity.stumbles }, result: state.result, hub: state.hub, settings: state.settings })); \n}\n};\nrender(); requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n\nif (state.hub.active) {\n  screen('hub');\n  window.AIHub.on('start', () => { state.hub.started = true; state.hub.startedAt = window.AIHub.time(); startActivity(ACTIVITIES.find(activity => activity.id === 'stork'), { second\ns: 60 }); });\n  window.AIHub.on('message', (data, from) => { state.hub.ghosts[from] = data; });\n  window.AIHub.on('time-up', () => { if (!state.hub.finished) { state.hub.finished = true; if (state.activity && state.screen === 'play') state.hub.score += state.activity.score / \nMath.max(1, state.activity.samples) * 1000; window.AIHub.result({ score: Math.round(state.hub.score) }); screen('hub'); } });\n  window.AIHub.on('end', () => { state.hub.finished = true; screen('hub'); });\n  window.AIHub.connect({ mode: 'ghost', seats: [1, 4], card: true }).then(() => window.AIHub.ready()).catch(() => notify('Unable to connect to the Hub.'));\n}\n\n--- art ---\n'use strict';\n\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('world');\nconst context = canvas.getContext('2d');\nlet artWidth = 0;\nlet artHeight = 0;\n\nfunction resizeArt() {\n  const ratio = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\n  artWidth = window.innerWidth;\n  artHeight = window.innerHeight;\n  canvas.width = Math.round(artWidth * ratio);\n  canvas.height = Math.round(artHeight * ratio);\n  context.setTransform(ratio, 0, 0, ratio, 0, 0);\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', resizeArt);\nresizeArt();\n\nfunction ellipse(x, y, rx, ry, color) {\n  context.fillStyle = color;\n  context.beginPath();\n  context.ellipse(x, y, Math.max(.1, rx), Math.max(.1, ry), 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n  context.fill();\n}\nfunction line(x1, y1, x2, y2, width, color) {\n  context.strokeStyle = color;\n  context.lineWidth = width;\n  context.lineCap = 'round';\n  context.beginPath();\n  context.moveTo(x1, y1);\n  context.lineTo(x2, y2);\n  context.stroke();\n}\nfunction rounded(x, y, width, height, radius, color) {\n  context.fillStyle = color;\n  context.beginPath();\n  context.roundRect(x, y, width, height, radius);\n  context.fill();\n}\nfunction drawCloud(x, y, size) {\n  ellipse(x, y, size * 1.4, size * .26, 'rgba(255,255,255,.48)');\n  ellipse(x - size * .45, y - size * .15, size * .55, size * .3, 'rgba(255,255,255,.48)');\n  ellipse(x + size * .25, y - size * .2, size * .65, size * .34, 'rgba(255,255,255,.48)');\n}\nfunction drawTree(x, y, size) {\n  line(x, y, x + size * .03, y - size * .8, size * .11, '#ac8066');\n  ellipse(x, y - size * .79, size * .37, size * .42, '#8ebaa1');\n  ellipse(x - size * .16, y - size * .87, size * .25, size * .3, '#a6ccae');\n}\nfunction drawTare(x, y, size, mood) {\n  ellipse(x, y + size * .12, size * .58, size * .13, 'rgba(50,90,80,.13)');\n  rounded(x - size * .47, y - size * .37, size * .94, size * .48, size * .13, '#e4ede8');\n  rounded(x - size * .47, y - size * .43, size * .94, size * .48, size * .13, '#fffefa');\n  rounded(x - size * .22, y - size * .31, size * .44, size * .2, size * .05, '#d9efdf');\n  ellipse(x - size * .08, y - size * .23, size * .025, size * .027, '#416b60');\n  ellipse(x + size * .08, y - size * .23, size * .025, size * .027, '#416b60');\n  context.strokeStyle = '#416b60'; context.lineWidth = Math.max(1, size * .015); context.beginPath();\n  context.arc(x, y - size * .2, size * .045, .2, Math.PI - .2); context.stroke();\n  if (mood) { context.fillStyle = '#e6ad65'; context.font = `bold ${size * .2}px sans-serif`; context.fillText('✦', x + size * .57, y - size * .46); }\n}\nfunction drawPerson(x, ground, size, options = {}) {\n  const sway = (options.lean || 0) * size * .13 + Math.sin((options.time || 0) * 1.3) * size * .008;\n  const movement = options.movement || 0;\n  const skin = options.skin || '#e8b69b';\n  const shirt = options.shirt || '#f1c86c';\n  const trousers = options.trousers || '#527d75';\n  ellipse(x, ground + size * .035, size * .39, size * .065, 'rgba(56,95,80,.13)');\n  line(x - size * .1, ground - size * .31, x - size * (.16 + movement * .08), ground - size * .03, size * .105, trousers);\n  line(x + size * .1, ground - size * .31, x + size * (.16 - movement * .08), ground - size * .03, size * .105, trousers);\n  line(x - size * (.16 + movement * .08), ground - size * .03, x - size * (.23 + movement * .08), ground - size * .03, size * .07, '#f9f8e9');\n  line(x + size * (.16 - movement * .08), ground - size * .03, x + size * (.23 - movement * .08), ground - size * .03, size * .07, '#f9f8e9');\n  line(x - size * .13 + sway, ground - size * .6, x - size * .35 + sway, ground - size * (.49 + Math.abs(movement) * .12), size * .08, skin);\n  line(x + size * .13 + sway, ground - size * .6, x + size * .35 + sway, ground - size * (.49 - Math.abs(movement) * .12), size * .08, skin);\n  rounded(x - size * .19 + sway, ground - size * .68, size * .38, size * .4, size * .12, shirt);\n  line(x + sway, ground - size * .71, x + sway, ground - size * .65, size * .105, skin);\n  ellipse(x + sway, ground - size * .85, size * .19, size * .22, skin);\n  ellipse(x + sway, ground - size * .99, size * .19, size * .105, '#52655a');\n  ellipse(x - size * .065 + sway, ground - size * .85, size * .013, size * .016, '#496156');\n  ellipse(x + size * .065 + sway, ground - size * .85, size * .013, size * .016, '#496156');\n  context.strokeStyle = '#a56d61'; context.lineWidth = Math.max(1, size * .012); context.beginPath();\n  context.arc(x + sway, ground - size * .81, size * .045, .1, Math.PI - .1); context.stroke();\n}\nfunction drawScenery(time) {\n  const width = artWidth, height = artHeight;\n  const sky = context.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, height);\n  sky.addColorStop(0, '#e3f4ef'); sky.addColorStop(.55, '#eff8e9'); sky.addColorStop(1, '#bfe3d3');\n  context.fillStyle = sky; context.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n  ellipse(width * .77, height * .19, Math.min(width, height) * .11, Math.min(width, height) * .11, '#fae9b5');\n  drawCloud(width * .67 + Math.sin(time * .08) * 9, height * .15, width * .08);\n  drawCloud(width * .92, height * .27, width * .05);\n  context.fillStyle = '#c9e7d7'; context.beginPath(); context.moveTo(0, height * .64); context.quadraticCurveTo(width * .24, height * .31, width * .45, height * .61); context.quadr\naticCurveTo(width * .67, height * .36, width, height * .63); context.lineTo(width, height); context.lineTo(0, height); context.fill();\n  context.fillStyle = '#aedbc9'; context.beginPath(); context.moveTo(0, height * .69); context.quadraticCurveTo(width * .21, height * .51, width * .44, height * .68); context.quadr\naticCurveTo(width * .72, height * .46, width, height * .65); context.lineTo(width, height); context.lineTo(0, height); context.fill();\n  context.fillStyle = '#cdebe0'; context.fillRect(0, height * .7, width, height * .3);\n  for (let index = 0; index < 11; index++) {\n    const rippleX = ((index * 191 + time * 5) % (width + 100)) - 50;\n    line(rippleX, height * (.74 + (index % 4) * .045), rippleX + 42 + index * 3, height * (.74 + (index % 4) * .045), 2, 'rgba(255,255,255,.35)');\n  }\n}\nfunction drawWorld(state) {\n  const width = artWidth, height = artHeight, time = state.clock || 0;\n  context.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n  drawScenery(time);\n  const compact = width < 700;\n  const active = state.screen === 'play' || state.screen === 'check';\n  const cx = compact ? width * .52 : active ? width * .5 : width * .73;\n  const cy = active ? height * .76 : compact ? height * .46 : height * .68;\n  const size = Math.min(width * (compact ? .63 : .30), height * .52);\n  ellipse(cx, cy + size * .19, size * 1.05, size * .28, '#a9cfb5');\n  ellipse(cx, cy + size * .13, size, size * .26, '#d5e7c4');\n  ellipse(cx, cy + size * .07, size * .91, size * .2, '#e9efd4');\n  drawTree(cx - size * .7, cy - size * .1, size * .42);\n  drawTree(cx + size * .72, cy - size * .08, size * .3);\n  if (!active) {\n    rounded(cx - size * .37, cy - size * .39, size * .53, size * .32, size * .025, '#fff9e9');\n    context.fillStyle = '#dfaa88'; context.beginPath(); context.moveTo(cx - size * .43, cy - size * .39); context.lineTo(cx - size * .11, cy - size * .58); context.lineTo(cx + size\n * .21, cy - size * .39); context.closePath(); context.fill();\n    rounded(cx - size * .12, cy - size * .29, size * .11, size * .2, size * .012, '#9ec6b2');\n    rounded(cx - size * .31, cy - size * .29, size * .12, size * .1, size * .01, '#b4ddd2');\n    ellipse(cx + size * .28, cy + size * .02, size * .31, size * .09, '#a4cfc1');\n    drawPerson(cx + size * .27, cy, size * .6, { time, movement: Math.sin(time * 1.2) * .2 });\n    drawTare(cx + size * .58, cy + size * .08, size * .24, true);\n    for (let index = 0; index < 5; index++) ellipse(cx - size * .6 + index * size * .07, cy + size * .12, 3, 3, index % 2 ? '#f6c888' : '#fff8e5');\n  } else {\n    const activity = state.activity;\n    const lean = activity ? activity.px : 0;\n    const movement = activity ? Math.sin(activity.elapsed * (activity.kind === 'jog' ? 5 : 2)) * .6 : 0;\n    ellipse(cx, cy + size * .05, size * .55, size * .12, '#a5d2bf');\n    drawPerson(cx, cy, size * .95, { time, lean, movement, shirt: state.shirt });\n    drawTare(cx + size * .55, cy + size * .06, size * .22, false);\n    if (activity && activity.kind === 'candle') {\n      rounded(cx - size * .65, cy - size * .14, size * .11, size * .16, 4, '#fffaf0');\n      ellipse(cx - size * .595, cy - size * .16, size * .035, size * (.055 + activity.flame * .06), '#f7c05b');\n    }\n    if (activity && activity.kind === 'hoop') {\n      context.strokeStyle = '#f5ae80'; context.lineWidth = size * .035; context.beginPath(); context.ellipse(cx, cy - size * .35, size * .36, size * .09, -.08, 0, Math.PI * 2); con\ntext.stroke();\n    }\n    if (activity && activity.kind === 'tray') {\n      line(cx - size * .38, cy - size * .49, cx + size * .38, cy - size * .49 + lean * size * .1, size * .045, '#bb8b6d');\n      ellipse(cx, cy - size * .52, size * .06, size * .035, '#849e67');\n    }\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
