row\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THE GENTLE GAMES</div><h1>Ready, steady,<br><em>be yourself.</em></h1><p>Three friendly challenges, ending in the Grand Stillness with Gertrude. The prize is a very nice feeling.</p><p class=\"note\">Challenge ${state.festivalIndex + 1} of 3 &nbsp; · &nbsp; ${['Stork Stand', 'Slalom', 'Quiet Candle'][state.festivalIndex]}</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Begin challenge', 'festival-start', true)}</div></div></main>`;\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/src/game.js:114:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; YOUR ISLAND IS ALWAYS HERE</div><div class=\"stars-big\">✳</div><h1>A little steadier.<br><em>A lot more you.</em></h1><p>Gertrude awards you the Golden Composure. Dennis is emotional. Tare insists the award is calibrated.</p><p class=\"note\">Thank you for five days of moving, breathing, and making room. The mats are yours whenever you wish.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Explore freely', 'free-play', true)}${button('About & credits', 'about')}</div></div></main>`;\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/src/game.js:115:  } else if (state.screen === 'class') {\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/src/game.js:117:    const players = state.classPlayers;\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/src/game.js:118:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; BETTER TOGETHER</div><h1>Make room for friends.</h1><p>Up to four share the same screen. One keyboard player; connect controllers for more.</p></div></div><div class=\"class-players\">${[0, 1, 2, 3].map((index) => `<div class=\"card player-tile\"><span class=\"slot-avatar\">${players[index] ? '☺' : '+'}</span><strong>${players[index] ? escapeHTML(players[index].name) : 'Open spot'}</strong><small>${players[index] ? escapeHTML(players[ind