{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_515","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; sed -n '1,145p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 180 | head -170; sed -n '\"'200,253p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\"; cat \"$D/tests/hub/bridge.js\" | head -25; rg -n '\"'playMs|scenario|URLSearchParams' \\\"\"'$D/tests/hub/harness.html\"; cat PROGRESS.md'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_515","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; sed -n '1,145p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | fold -w 180 | head -170; sed -n '\"'200,253p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\"; cat \"$D/tests/hub/bridge.js\" | head -25; rg -n '\"'playMs|scenario|URLSearchParams' \\\"\"'$D/tests/hub/harness.html\"; cat PROGRESS.md'","aggregated_output":"'use strict';\n\nconst app = document.getElementById('app');\nconst STORAGE = 'wee-bit-of-zen-v1';\nconst DEFAULT_SETTINGS = { music: 10, sound: 10, voice: true, gentle: false, breathToggle: false, tips: true, glyphs: 'PlayStation' };\nlet stored;\ntry { stored = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE) || '{}'); } catch (_) { stored = {}; }\nconst state = {\n  screen: 'title', clock: 0, idle: 0, input: 'keyboard', settings: { ...DEFAULT_SETTINGS, ...(stored.settings || {}) },\n  slots: Array.isArray(stored.slots) ? stored.slots : [null, null, null], slot: 0, member: null,\n  selection: null, activity: null, returnScreen: 'title', check: null, toast: '', classPlayers: [],\n  festival: false, festivalIndex: 0, hub: { active: !!window.AIHub?.active, started: false, finished: false, score: 0, lastSend: 0, lastProgress: 0, ghosts: {} }\n};\nwhile (state.slots.length < 3) state.slots.push(null);\nconst keys = new Set();\nlet mouseLean = null, lastFrame = 0, lastHud = 0, audioContext = null, nextMusic = 0, gamepadPrevious = [];\nlet toggledBreath = false, pausedFrom = null;\n\nfunction save() {\n  if (state.hub.active) return;\n  if (state.member) state.slots[state.slot] = state.member;\n  try { localStorage.setItem(STORAGE, JSON.stringify({ settings: state.settings, slots: state.slots })); } catch (_) { notify('Saving is unavailable in this browser.'); }\n}\nfunction notify(text) {\n  state.toast = text;\n  const node = document.getElementById('toast');\n  if (node) { node.textContent = text; node.hidden = false; }\n  setTimeout(() => { if (state.toast === text) { state.toast = ''; const toast = document.getElementById('toast'); if (toast) toast.hidden = true; } }, 3000);\n}\nfunction tone(frequency, duration = .14, volume = .5, type = 'sine') {\n  if (!audioContext || audioContext.state !== 'running' || !state.settings.sound) return;\n  const oscillator = audioContext.createOscillator(), gain = audioContext.createGain(), now = audioContext.currentTime;\n  oscillator.type = type; oscillator.frequency.setValueAtTime(frequency, now);\n  gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001, now); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(.00011, state.settings.sound / 100 * volume * .18), now + .015); gain.gain.exponentialRampTo\nValueAtTime(.0001, now + duration);\n  oscillator.connect(gain); gain.connect(audioContext.destination); oscillator.start(now); oscillator.stop(now + duration + .01);\n}\nfunction unlockAudio() {\n  try { if (!audioContext) audioContext = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)(); if (audioContext.state === 'suspended') audioContext.resume(); } catch (_) {}\n}\nfunction music() {\n  if (!audioContext || audioContext.state !== 'running' || !state.settings.music || state.clock < nextMusic) return;\n  nextMusic = state.clock + 1.25;\n  const notes = [261.63, 329.63, 392, 493.88, 392, 329.63, 293.66, 349.23];\n  const oscillator = audioContext.createOscillator(), gain = audioContext.createGain(), now = audioContext.currentTime;\n  oscillator.type = 'sine'; oscillator.frequency.value = notes[Math.floor(state.clock / 1.25) % notes.length];\n  gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001, now); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(.00011, state.settings.music / 100 * .035), now + .08); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTi\nme(.0001, now + 1.1);\n  oscillator.connect(gain); gain.connect(audioContext.destination); oscillator.start(now); oscillator.stop(now + 1.15);\n}\nfunction hint() { return state.input === 'gamepad' ? (state.settings.glyphs === 'Xbox' ? 'A SELECT  ·  B BACK' : '✕ SELECT  ·  ○ BACK') : '↑ ↓ CHOOSE  ·  ENTER SELECT  ·  ESC BACK'\n; }\nfunction button(label, action, primary = false, id = '', detail = '') {\n  return `<button class=\"action${primary ? ' primary' : ''}\" data-action=\"${action}\" data-id=\"${escapeHTML(id)}\"><span>${label}${detail ? `<small>${detail}</small>` : ''}</span><sp\nan class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button>`;\n}\nfunction shell(content, label = '', footer = true) {\n  return `<div class=\"page\"><header class=\"topbar\"><button class=\"brand\" data-action=\"home\" aria-label=\"Return to title\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">✳</span><span>WEE BIT <b>OF ZEN</b\n></span></button><span class=\"top-label\">${label}</span><button class=\"settings-link\" data-action=\"settings\" aria-label=\"Settings\">⚙ <span>SETTINGS</span></button></header>${conten\nt}${footer ? `<footer class=\"footer\"><span>${hint()}</span><span>THE INSTITUTE FOR GENTLE IMPROVEMENT&nbsp; ✳ &nbsp; LUMBAR ISLAND</span></footer>` : ''}</div><div class=\"toast\" id\n=\"toast\" hidden></div>`;\n}\nfunction screen(name) { state.screen = name; state.idle = 0; render(); }\nfunction person() { return state.member || { name: 'Guest', day: 1, sessions: 0, minutes: 0, stars: {}, instructor: 'Birch', color: 1, outfit: 1, finished: false }; }\nfunction labelDay() { const member = person(); return member.finished ? 'FREE PRACTICE' : `DAY ${member.day} OF 5`; }\nfunction tile(activity, locked = false) {\n  const group = GROUPS[activity.group], stars = person().stars?.[activity.id] || 0;\n  return `<button class=\"activity ${locked ? 'locked' : ''}\" data-action=\"${locked ? 'locked' : 'select-activity'}\" data-id=\"${activity.id}\" style=\"--group:${group.color};--group-l\night:${group.light}\"><span class=\"activity-icon\">${activity.icon}</span><span class=\"activity-copy\"><span class=\"activity-group\">${group.name}</span><strong>${activity.name}</stron\ng><small>${locked ? `Opens day ${activity.day}` : activity.tagline}</small></span><span class=\"activity-end\">${locked ? '⌁' : (stars ? '★'.repeat(stars) : '↗')}</span></button>`;\n}\nfunction settingRow(label, value, action, id = '') { return `<div class=\"row\"><span>${label}</span><button class=\"chip setting-button\" data-action=\"${action}\" data-id=\"${id}\">${val\nue}</button></div>`; }\nfunction aboutContent() {\n  const info = window.BUILD_INFO || {}, sections = [ ['Source Information', info.sourceInformation], ['Testing Feedback', info.testingFeedback], ['Engine Feedback', info.engineFeed\nback], ['Prompt Feedback', info.promptFeedback] ];\n  return sections.map(([title, value]) => `<div class=\"about-group\"><h3>${title}</h3>${Array.isArray(value) ? value.map((item, index) => `<p><b>${index + 1}.</b> ${escapeHTML(item)\n}</p>`).join('') : Object.entries(value || {}).map(([key, item]) => `<p><b>${escapeHTML(key)}:</b> ${escapeHTML(item)}</p>`).join('')}</div>`).join('');\n}\nfunction render() {\n  const member = person();\n  let content = '', heading = '';\n  if (state.screen === 'title' || state.screen === 'attract') {\n    content = `<main class=\"hero\"><section class=\"hero-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"sun-dot\">✳</span> A LITTLE ISLAND FOR YOURSELF</div><h1 class=\"logo\">wee bit<br><em>o\nf zen</em><span class=\"logo-dot\">.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">A pleasantly imperfect retreat for<br>your body, mind, and general wobble.</p><div class=\"menu-stack\">${button('Begin \nyour stay', 'slots', true, '', 'A little time just for you')}${button('Local Class', 'class', false, '', 'Practice together, up to four')}${button('About & credits', 'about')}</div\n></section><div class=\"island-message\"><span>✦ &nbsp; TAKE IT AT YOUR OWN PACE</span><strong>Good things happen<br>one wobble at a time.</strong></div></main>`;\n    if (state.screen === 'attract') content += '<div class=\"center-copy\">DEMONSTRATION &nbsp; · &nbsp; PRESS ANY KEY</div>';\n  } else if (state.screen === 'slots') {\n    heading = 'YOUR STAY';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THE GUEST BOOK</div><h1>Make yourself at home.</h1><p>Choose a room for your isl\nand stay.</p></div></div><div class=\"card-grid\">${state.slots.map((slot, index) => `<button class=\"card slot-card\" data-action=\"slot\" data-id=\"${index}\"><span class=\"slot-num\">0${i\nndex + 1}</span><span class=\"slot-avatar\">${slot ? '☺' : '+'}</span><strong>${slot ? escapeHTML(slot.name) : 'New member'}</strong><small>${slot ? `${slot.finished ? 'Free practice\n' : `Day ${slot.day}`} · ${Math.floor(slot.minutes || 0)} fit minutes` : 'A fresh start awaits'}</small><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"actions\">\n${button('Back', 'home')}</div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'setup') {\n    heading = 'NEW MEMBER';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; NICE TO MEET YOU</div><h1>A little about you.</h1><p>There is no wrong wa\ny to arrive.</p></div></div><div class=\"card setup-card\"><label class=\"field\">WHAT SHOULD WE CALL YOU?<input id=\"nickname\" maxlength=\"16\" value=\"${escapeHTML(member.name === 'Guest\n' ? '' : member.name)}\" placeholder=\"Your name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><p class=\"field-label\">CHOOSE YOUR COLOUR</p><div class=\"options\">${OUTFITS.map((color, index) => `<butto\nn class=\"option swatch ${member.outfit === index ? 'selected' : ''}\" data-action=\"outfit\" data-id=\"${index}\" style=\"--swatch:${color}\" aria-label=\"Outfit ${index + 1}\">${member.out\nfit === index ? '✓' : ''}</button>`).join('')}</div><p class=\"field-label\">YOUR INSTRUCTOR</p><div class=\"options\">${['Birch', 'Alder'].map(name => `<button class=\"option ${member.\ninstructor === name ? 'selected' : ''}\" data-action=\"instructor\" data-id=\"${name}\">${name === 'Birch' ? '✳' : '✦'} &nbsp; ${name}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"actions\">${b\nutton('Back', 'slots')}${button('Arrive on the island', 'create-member', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'intro') {\n    heading = labelDay();\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"dialogue card\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; A NOTE FROM TARE</div><div class=\"speaker\">☺</div><h1>Welcome${member.day ===\n 1 ? ', ' + escapeHTML(member.name) : ' back'}.</h1><p>“${DAY_INTROS[Math.min(4, member.day - 1)]}”</p><p class=\"note\">Your stay starts with a gentle body check. No weights, no jud\ngement, and absolutely no pop quizzes. Well, one tiny quiz.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Begin body check', 'check', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'check') {\n    heading = 'BODY CHECK';\n    content = `<main class=\"play-hud\"><div class=\"hud-top\"><div class=\"hud-box\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; BODY CHECK</div><h2>Just checking in.</h2><p id=\"check-text\">Find a co\nmfortable center.</p></div><div class=\"hud-box timer\" id=\"check-timer\">05</div></div><div class=\"hud-bottom\"><div class=\"play-instruction\">${state.check?.phase === 'lean' ? 'Lean i\nn each direction: ← ↑ → ↓' : 'Stay steady. Small wobbles are welcome.'}</div><div class=\"meter\"><span id=\"check-progress\"></span></div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'question') {\n    heading = 'BODY CHECK';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ONE VERY SCIENTIFIC QUESTION</div><h1>How are you arriving today?</h1><p>Your\n answer helps us calibrate the island's extremely sophisticated vibes.</p><div class=\"menu-stack\">${button('Bright-eyed and bushy-tailed', 'question-answer', true, 'bright')}${butt\non('A little wobbly, honestly', 'question-answer', false, 'wobbly')}${button('Mostly thinking about snacks', 'question-answer', false, 'snacks')}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'check-result') {\n    heading = 'BODY CHECK COMPLETE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ACCORDING TO TARE</div><div class=\"score-big\">${state.check.spine}</div><h1>Y\nour Spine Age</h1><p>“A completely imaginary number. Your actual spine remains splendid.”</p><p class=\"note\">Today is a fine day to practice being here.</p><div class=\"actions\">${b\nutton('Explore the island', 'island', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'island') {\n    heading = labelDay();\n    const dialogue = CAST[(member.day + member.sessions) % CAST.length];\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap island-main\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ${labelDay()} &nbsp; / &nbsp; ${Math.floor(member.minutes || 0)} FIT\n MINUTES</div><h1>Find your kind of movement.</h1><p>${member.finished ? 'The island is yours. Stay as long as you like.' : `Hello, ${escapeHTML(member.name)}. Choose a mat and set\ntle in.`}</p></div><div class=\"day-badge\"><strong>${member.sessions || 0}<small>/ 3</small></strong><span>TODAY'S<br>SESSIONS</span></div></div><div class=\"activity-grid\">${ACTIVIT\nIES.map(activity => tile(activity, !member.finished && activity.day > member.day)).join('')}</div><div class=\"island-bar\"><p><b>${dialogue[0]} says:</b> “${dialogue[1]}”</p><div cl\nass=\"map-actions\">${button('Local Class', 'class')}${button(member.finished ? 'Your story' : member.day === 5 ? 'Gentle Games' : 'End the day', member.finished ? 'ending' : 'sleep'\n, true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'activity') {\n    const activity = state.selection, group = GROUPS[activity.group]; heading = group.name.toUpperCase();\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card activity-detail\" style=\"--group:${group.color};--group-light:${group.light}\"><div class=\"activity-large-icon\">${activ\nity.icon}</div><div class=\"eyebrow\">${group.icon} &nbsp; ${group.name.toUpperCase()} &nbsp; / &nbsp; ${activity.seconds} SECONDS</div><h1>${activity.name}</h1><p>${activity.tagline\n}</p><div class=\"divider\"></div><h3>How to play</h3><p>${activity.instruction}</p><p class=\"note\">Lean with WASD, arrow keys, left stick or mouse. ${state.settings.gentle ? 'Gentle\n mode is on.' : 'Make small, comfortable movements.'}</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Back to island', state.classMode ? 'class' : 'island')}${button('Begin practice', 'start-act\nivity', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'play') {\n    const activity = state.activity, group = GROUPS[activity.group]; heading = group.name.toUpperCase();\n    content = `<main class=\"play-hud\"><div class=\"hud-top\"><div class=\"hud-box\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">${group.icon} &nbsp; ${group.name.toUpperCase()}</div><h2>${activity.name}</h2>\n<p id=\"play-status\">Find your center.</p></div><div class=\"hud-box timer\"><span id=\"play-timer\">${Math.ceil(activity.seconds)}</span><small>SEC</small></div></div><div class=\"balan\nce-plate\" aria-label=\"Balance indicator\"><span class=\"plate-ring\" id=\"plate-ring\"></span><span class=\"plate-dot\" id=\"plate-dot\"></span></div><div class=\"hud-bottom\"><div class=\"pla\ny-instruction\" id=\"play-instruction\">${activity.instruction}</div><div class=\"meter\"><span id=\"play-progress\"></span></div><div class=\"hud-caption\"><span id=\"play-score\">A GENTLE S\nTART</span><span>ESC / OPTIONS &nbsp; PAUSE</span></div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'result') {\n    const result = state.result;\n    heading = 'SESSION COMPLETE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue result-card\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; PRACTICE COMPLETE</div><div class=\"stars-big\">${'★'.repeat(result\n.stars)}<span>${'☆'.repeat(3 - result.stars)}</span></div><h1>Lovely work${state.classMode ? ', everyone' : ''}.</h1><p>“${result.message}”</p><div class=\"result-stats\"><div><stron\ng>${result.percent}%</strong><small>STEADINESS</small></div><div><strong>+${result.minutes}</strong><small>FIT MINUTES</small></div><div><strong>${result.stumbles}</strong><small>W\nOBBLES</small></div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Practice again', 'retry')}${button(state.festival ? 'Continue the Games' : state.classMode ? 'Class results' : 'Back to isl\nand', 'result-continue', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'recap') {\n    heading = 'DAY COMPLETE';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; ANOTHER DAY WELL SPENT</div><h1>Rest is part of it.</h1><p>“${member.sessions\n} sessions today. Gerald the ceramic hippo has made a careful note.”</p><div class=\"result-stats\"><div><strong>${Math.floor(member.minutes)}</strong><small>FIT MINUTES</small></div\n><div><strong>${Object.keys(member.stars || {}).length}</strong><small>MATS VISITED</small></div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Wake up to day ' + (member.day + 1), 'next-day\n', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'festival') {\n    heading = 'DAY 5 &nbsp; / &nbsp; GENTLE GAMES';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THE GENTLE GAMES</div><h1>Ready, steady,<br><em>be yourself.</em></h1><p>Thre\ne friendly challenges, ending in the Grand Stillness with Gertrude. The prize is a very nice feeling.</p><p class=\"note\">Challenge ${state.festivalIndex + 1} of 3 &nbsp; · &nbsp; $\n{['Stork Stand', 'Slalom', 'Quiet Candle'][state.festivalIndex]}</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Begin challenge', 'festival-start', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'ending') {\n    heading = 'THANK YOU FOR STAYING';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"card dialogue\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; YOUR ISLAND IS ALWAYS HERE</div><div class=\"stars-big\">✳</div><h1>A little st\neadier.<br><em>A lot more you.</em></h1><p>Gertrude awards you the Golden Composure. Dennis is emotional. Tare insists the award is calibrated.</p><p class=\"note\">Thank you for fiv\n  activity.vx += ax * dt; activity.vy += ay * dt; activity.px += activity.vx * dt; activity.py += activity.vy * dt;\n  if (Math.hypot(activity.px, activity.py) >= 1 && activity.stun <= 0) { activity.stumbles++; activity.stun = 1; activity.px *= .5; activity.py *= .5; activity.vx *= -.2; activity.vy *= -.2; tone(196, .18); }\n  const phase = Math.floor(time / 12), rng = seeded(phase * 667 + 43);\n  activity.ringX = activity.id === 'stork' ? (rng() - .5) * .65 : activity.kind === 'slalom' ? Math.sin(time * .55) * .46 : 0;\n  activity.ringY = activity.id === 'stork' ? (rng() - .5) * .35 : 0;\n  const distance = Math.hypot(activity.px - activity.ringX, activity.py - activity.ringY), ringSize = state.settings.gentle ? .48 : .38;\n  const steadiness = clamp(1 - distance * 1.4, 0, 1);\n  let quality = steadiness;\n  const held = state.settings.breathToggle ? toggledBreath : keys.has(' ') || !!pad?.buttons[7]?.pressed;\n  activity.effort = clamp(activity.effort + (held ? 1 : -1) * dt / 4, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'rep') { const goal = (Math.sin(time * Math.PI / 2 - Math.PI / 2) + 1) / 2; quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.effort - goal), 0, 1) * steadiness; activity.reps = Math.floor(time / 4); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'breath') { const inhale = Math.sin(time * Math.PI / 4) > 0; quality = steadiness * (held === inhale ? 1 : .5); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'step') quality = clamp(activity.beatHits / Math.max(1, time * 100 / 60) * 1.5, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'hoop') { activity.motions += (Math.abs(activity.vx) + Math.abs(activity.vy)) * dt; quality = clamp(activity.motions / Math.max(1, time) * 3 + activity.hoopHits / Math.max(1, time / 10), 0, 1); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'jog') quality = clamp(activity.jogHits / Math.max(1, time * 2) * 1.5, 0, 1) * steadiness;\n  if (activity.kind === 'slalom') quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.px - activity.ringX) * 1.5, 0, 1);\n  if (activity.kind === 'tray') { activity.tray += (activity.px - activity.tray) * dt * 1.5; quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.tray) * 2, 0, 1); }\n  if (activity.kind === 'rope') quality = clamp(1 - Math.abs(activity.px) * 2, 0, 1) * (activity.uy < -.1 ? 1 : .65);\n  if (activity.kind === 'candle') { activity.flame = clamp(activity.flame + (distance < ringSize ? .13 : -.3) * dt, 0, 1); quality = activity.flame; }\n  activity.score += quality; activity.samples++;\n  if (state.classMode && !state.hub.active) updateClass(dt);\n  if (state.hub.active) {\n    const now = window.AIHub.time();\n    if (now - state.hub.lastSend >= 100) { state.hub.lastSend = now; window.AIHub.send({ x: activity.px, y: activity.py, exercise: activity.id }); }\n    if (now - state.hub.lastProgress >= 1000) { state.hub.lastProgress = now; window.AIHub.progress({ score: Math.round(state.hub.score + activity.score / Math.max(1, activity.samples) * 1000), label: activity.name }); }\n  }\n  if (!state.hub.active && activity.elapsed >= activity.seconds) completeActivity();\n}\nfunction updateHUD() {\n  const activity = state.activity; if (!activity) return;\n  const timer = document.getElementById('play-timer'), status = document.getElementById('play-status'), instruction = document.getElementById('play-instruction'), progress = document.getElementById('play-progress'), dot = document.getElementById('plate-dot'), ring = document.getElementById('plate-ring'), score = document.getElementById('play-score');\n  if (!timer) return;\n  timer.textContent = Math.max(0, Math.ceil(activity.seconds - activity.elapsed));\n  if (activity.kind === 'step') { const arrows = ['←','↑','→','↓']; const beat = Math.round(activity.elapsed * 100 / 60); status.textContent = `NEXT STEP  ${arrows[(beat + 4) % 4]}   ·   ${activity.beatHits} on beat`; instruction.textContent = `Press ${arrows[(beat + 4) % 4]} on the beat · ${activity.instruction}`; }\n  else if (activity.kind === 'rep') status.textContent = `Rep ${activity.reps + 1} · ${Math.sin(activity.elapsed * Math.PI / 2 - Math.PI / 2) > 0 ? 'Rise gently' : 'Lower gently'}`;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'breath') status.textContent = Math.sin(activity.elapsed * Math.PI / 4) > 0 ? 'Breathe in · hold' : 'Breathe out · release';\n  else if (activity.kind === 'candle') status.textContent = `Flame ${Math.round(activity.flame * 100)}% · ${activity.flame < .15 ? 'settle to relight' : 'let it glow'}`;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'jog') status.textContent = `${activity.jogHits} steps · alternate J and K`;\n  else if (activity.kind === 'hoop') status.textContent = `${activity.hoopHits} catches · circle your lean`;\n  else status.textContent = activity.stun > 0 ? 'A wobble! Take a moment.' : 'Find the ring. Breathe naturally.';\n  progress.style.width = `${clamp(activity.elapsed / activity.seconds * 100, 0, 100)}%`;\n  dot.style.transform = `translate(${activity.px * 70}px, ${activity.py * 70}px)`;\n  ring.style.transform = `translate(${activity.ringX * 70}px, ${activity.ringY * 70}px)`;\n  score.textContent = `${Math.round(activity.score / Math.max(1, activity.samples) * 100)}% STEADY`;\n}\nfunction updateCheckHUD() {\n  if (!state.check) return;\n  const timer = document.getElementById('check-timer'), text = document.getElementById('check-text'), progress = document.getElementById('check-progress');\n  if (!timer) return;\n  timer.textContent = state.check.phase === 'still' ? String(Math.max(0, Math.ceil(5 - state.check.elapsed))).padStart(2, '0') : `${state.check.directions.size}/4`;\n  text.textContent = state.check.phase === 'still' ? 'Find a comfortable center.' : 'Lean left, up, right and down.';\n  progress.style.width = `${state.check.phase === 'still' ? clamp(state.check.elapsed / 5 * 50, 0, 50) : 50 + state.check.directions.size * 12.5}%`;\n}\nfunction update(dt) {\n/**\n * bridge.js — the hub's end of one game frame in a session.\n *\n * A game speaks the AI Hub Session Protocol over postMessage (lib/hub/README.md).\n * The bridge checks every message, enforces the limits, and routes it: control\n * messages (hello, ready, result, finish, error) to whoever coordinates the\n * round (lib/hub/round.js), game traffic straight to the other players, and a\n * game's answers on its own card to the page that holds it. What\n * comes back from the network is checked again before it reaches the game,\n * and anything from another round is dropped, so a slow packet can never land\n * in the next game.\n *\n * The network is anything with `send(toKey, envelope, {reliable})`: the\n * simulated one below (harness, tests), a BroadcastChannel between tabs, or a\n * WebRTC mesh. Envelopes:\n *   {k:'c', r, m}       to the coordinator: a message from this game\n *   {k:'h', r, m}       from the coordinator: welcome, start, leave, time-up, end\n *   {k:'g', r, f, d}    game traffic from player id f\n *   {k:'p', r, f, d}    player id f's progress, {score, label}, for the scoreboard\n */\n\nexport const LIMITS = Object.freeze({\n  maxBytes: 16_384,\n  ratePerS: 20,\n  burst: 40,\n70:const params = new URLSearchParams(location.search);\n73:const scenario = params.get('scenario') || 'standard';\n74:/** ?scenario=server: the shared world runs on one more copy with no player of its own, as a dedicated server would run it. */\n75:const serverMode = scenario === 'server';\n76:const playMs = Number(params.get('play')) || 6000;\n411:  const report = { done: false, pass: false, game: $('game').value, players: Number($('players').value), scenario, checks, log: logLines };\n465:    await randomly(Math.min(1500, playMs / 4));\n477:    if (scenario === 'host-leave') removeCell(state.cells[0]);\n479:    await randomly(playMs / 2);\n505:    if (scenario === 'host-leave' && !SELF_REPORTED.includes(state.coordinator.mode)) {\n# Progress\n\n## Handoff\n- Game title: Wee Bit of Zen\n- Deliverable basename: `Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356`\n- Build a complete, single-file game from `PLAN.md` and follow `TASK.md` for the handoff.\n\n## Status\n- [x] Read the task and begin extracting the game design.\n- [x] Fetch the required engine, mocap clips, and AI Hub client and harness.\n- [x] Integrate the fixed-step engine and load the AI Hub client.\n- [x] Implement the island, 12 activities, story, saves, settings, and initial class mode.\n- [x] Produce the first self-contained HTML and a provisional structured exit interview.\n- [x] Finish multiplayer scoring, the three-event AI Hub session, and motion integration.\n- [ ] Exercise the game and inspect responsive, cross-browser screenshots; finalize the interview.\n\n## Notes\n- Keep all project work inside this run's workspace; do not inspect sibling runs.\n- Use Playwright's WebKit as the available approximation of iOS Safari.\n- The original handoff, motion sources, and hub client are in the development folder; `vendor/fitclips.js` is the generated local clip set.\n- Build with `node 'Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/build.mjs'`; this also copies the standalone build into the Hub harness.\n- A local preview is running at `http://127.0.0.1:32893/` in exec session `68330`; stop only that session when finished.\n- The first Chromium smoke test opened the standalone successfully. Multiplayer, Hub sequencing, motion, and responsive layout still need full verification.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
