te and inspect responsive screenshots.\n- `tests/run.py` starts its own localhost server and exercises a scripted story, all activities, multiplayer, Hub conformance, audio, accessibility settings, and browser smoke tests.\n/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/python3\n/home/micha/.local/lib/python3.14/site-packages/playwright/__init__.py\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
