{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_665","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; sed -n '185,260p' \\\"\"'$D/tests/run.py\"; sed -n '\"'42,83p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\"; rg -n '\"'swatch|settings-back|action ===|name ===' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | head -n 30; cat \"$D/engine/package.json\" 2>/dev/null | head -n 20; rg -n '\"'0\\\\.89\\\\.0' \\\"\"'$D/engine\" | head'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_665","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"D='Wee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356'; sed -n '185,260p' \\\"\"'$D/tests/run.py\"; sed -n '\"'42,83p' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\"; rg -n '\"'swatch|settings-back|action ===|name ===' \\\"\"'$D/src/game.js\" | head -n 30; cat \"$D/engine/package.json\" 2>/dev/null | head -n 20; rg -n '\"'0\\\\.89\\\\.0' \\\"\"'$D/engine\" | head'","aggregated_output":"def smoke(browser, label, context_options=None):\n    context = browser.new_context(**(context_options or {}))\n    page = context.new_page()\n    errors = []\n    page.on('pageerror', lambda error: errors.append(str(error)))\n    try:\n        page.goto(URL, wait_until='load')\n        page.wait_for_function('window.__ZEN !== undefined')\n        check(f'{label} renders title', page.evaluate(\"__ZEN.state.screen === 'title'\"))\n        if context_options and context_options.get('has_touch'):\n            check(f'{label} shows required controller notice', page.get_by_text('Controller or keyboard required').count() == 1)\n            page.locator('.touch-notice [data-action=\"settings\"]').click()\n            check(f'{label} can open settings', page.evaluate(\"__ZEN.state.screen === 'settings'\"))\n        else:\n            page.evaluate(\"__ZEN.action('slots'); __ZEN.action('slot', '0'); __ZEN.action('create-member'); __ZEN.action('check'); __ZEN.step(20)\")\n            check(f'{label} plays check-in', page.evaluate(\"__ZEN.state.screen === 'question'\"))\n        check(f'{label} has no JavaScript errors', not errors, '; '.join(errors))\n    except Exception as error:\n        check(f'{label} smoke test', False, str(error).splitlines()[0])\n    finally:\n        context.close()\n\n\ndef main():\n    global HUB_URL\n    server = ThreadingHTTPServer(('127.0.0.1', 0), partial(QuietHandler, directory=str(ROOT)))\n    Thread(target=server.serve_forever, daemon=True).start()\n    HUB_URL = f'http://127.0.0.1:{server.server_port}/{quote(NAME)}/tests/hub/harness.html'\n    with sync_playwright() as playwright:\n        chromium = playwright.chromium.launch(headless=True, args=['--autoplay-policy=no-user-gesture-required'])\n        context = chromium.new_context(viewport={'width': 1280, 'height': 720})\n        page = context.new_page()\n        errors = []\n        page.on('pageerror', lambda error: errors.append(str(error)))\n        try:\n            gameplay(page)\n        except Exception as error:\n            check('Chromium playthrough ran', False, str(error).splitlines()[0])\n        check('Chromium playthrough has no JavaScript errors', not errors, '; '.join(errors))\n        context.close()\n        for players in [1, 2, 3, 4]:\n            hub(chromium, players)\n        hub(chromium, 4, 'host-leave')\n        chromium.close()\n        for engine in ['firefox', 'webkit']:\n            browser = getattr(playwright, engine).launch(headless=True)\n            smoke(browser, engine)\n            if engine == 'webkit':\n                smoke(browser, 'iPhone WebKit', playwright.devices['iPhone 13'])\n            browser.close()\n    server.shutdown()\n    server.server_close()\n    print(f'{checks} checks, {failures} failures')\n    return 1 if failures else 0\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    try:\n        sys.exit(main())\n    except Exception as error:\n        check('test runner', False, str(error).splitlines()[0])\n        print(f'{checks} checks, {failures} failures')\n        sys.exit(1)\n  nextMusic = state.clock + 1.25;\n  const notes = [261.63, 329.63, 392, 493.88, 392, 329.63, 293.66, 349.23];\n  const oscillator = audioContext.createOscillator(), gain = audioContext.createGain(), now = audioContext.currentTime;\n  oscillator.type = 'sine'; oscillator.frequency.value = notes[Math.floor(state.clock / 1.25) % notes.length];\n  gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001, now); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(.00011, state.settings.music / 100 * .035), now + .08); gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001, now + 1.1);\n  oscillator.connect(gain); gain.connect(audioContext.destination); oscillator.start(now); oscillator.stop(now + 1.15);\n}\nfunction hint() { return state.input === 'gamepad' ? (state.settings.glyphs === 'Xbox' ? 'A SELECT  ·  B BACK' : '✕ SELECT  ·  ○ BACK') : '↑ ↓ CHOOSE  ·  ENTER SELECT  ·  ESC BACK'; }\nfunction button(label, action, primary = false, id = '', detail = '') {\n  return `<button class=\"action${primary ? ' primary' : ''}\" data-action=\"${action}\" data-id=\"${escapeHTML(id)}\"><span>${label}${detail ? `<small>${detail}</small>` : ''}</span><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button>`;\n}\nfunction shell(content, label = '', footer = true) {\n  return `<div class=\"page page--${state.screen}\"><header class=\"topbar\"><button class=\"brand\" data-action=\"home\" aria-label=\"Return to title\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">✳</span><span>WEE BIT <b>OF ZEN</b></span></button><span class=\"top-label\">${label}</span><button class=\"settings-link\" data-action=\"settings\" aria-label=\"Settings\">⚙ <span>SETTINGS</span></button></header>${content}${footer ? `<footer class=\"footer\"><span>${hint()}</span><span>THE INSTITUTE FOR GENTLE IMPROVEMENT&nbsp; ✳ &nbsp; LUMBAR ISLAND</span></footer>` : ''}</div><div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" hidden></div>`;\n}\nfunction screen(name) { state.screen = name; state.idle = 0; render(); }\nfunction person() { return state.member || { name: 'Guest', day: 1, sessions: 0, minutes: 0, stars: {}, instructor: 'Birch', color: 1, outfit: 1, finished: false }; }\nfunction labelDay() { const member = person(); return member.finished ? 'FREE PRACTICE' : `DAY ${member.day} OF 5`; }\nfunction tile(activity, locked = false) {\n  const group = GROUPS[activity.group], stars = person().stars?.[activity.id] || 0;\n  return `<button class=\"activity ${locked ? 'locked' : ''}\" data-action=\"${locked ? 'locked' : 'select-activity'}\" data-id=\"${activity.id}\" style=\"--group:${group.color};--group-light:${group.light}\"><span class=\"activity-icon\">${activity.icon}</span><span class=\"activity-copy\"><span class=\"activity-group\">${group.name}</span><strong>${activity.name}</strong><small>${locked ? `Opens day ${activity.day}` : activity.tagline}</small></span><span class=\"activity-end\">${locked ? '⌁' : (stars ? '★'.repeat(stars) : '↗')}</span></button>`;\n}\nfunction settingRow(label, value, action, id = '') { return `<div class=\"row\"><span>${label}</span><button class=\"chip setting-button\" data-action=\"${action}\" data-id=\"${id}\">${value}</button></div>`; }\nfunction aboutContent() {\n  const info = window.BUILD_INFO || {}, sections = [ ['Source Information', info.sourceInformation], ['Testing Feedback', info.testingFeedback], ['Engine Feedback', info.engineFeedback], ['Prompt Feedback', info.promptFeedback] ];\n  const questions = {\n    'Testing Feedback': ['How many issues did testing catch?', 'How many were critical or game breaking?', 'What was the most helpful test?', 'What was the least helpful test?'],\n    'Engine Feedback': ['What did you like most about the engine?', 'Did you get stuck or guess wrong?', 'What was the most important thing you built yourself?', 'What was the hardest part about using the engine?', 'What did you change in the engine, and why?', 'What one thing would you change about the engine?'],\n    'Prompt Feedback': ['What did you like most about this prompt?', 'What was confusing?', 'What was the hardest thing to do?', 'What would you change in this prompt?']\n  };\n  return sections.map(([title, value]) => `<div class=\"about-group\"><h3>${title}</h3>${Array.isArray(value) ? value.map((item, index) => `<p><b>${escapeHTML(questions[title]?.[index] || `${index + 1}.`)}</b> ${escapeHTML(item)}</p>`).join('') : Object.entries(value || {}).map(([key, item]) => `<p><b>${escapeHTML(key)}:</b> ${escapeHTML(item)}</p>`).join('')}</div>`).join('');\n}\nfunction render() {\n  const member = person();\n  let content = '', heading = '';\n  if (state.screen === 'title' || state.screen === 'attract') {\n    content = `<main class=\"hero\"><section class=\"hero-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"sun-dot\">✳</span> A LITTLE ISLAND FOR YOURSELF</div><h1 class=\"logo\">wee bit<br><em>of zen</em><span class=\"logo-dot\">.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">A pleasantly imperfect retreat for<br>your body, mind, and general wobble.</p><div class=\"menu-stack\">${button('Begin your stay', 'slots', true, '', 'A little time just for you')}${button('Local Class', 'class', false, '', 'Practice together, up to four')}${button('About & credits', 'about')}</div></section><div class=\"island-message\"><span>✦ &nbsp; TAKE IT AT YOUR OWN PACE</span><strong>Good things happen<br>one wobble at a time.</strong></div></main>`;\n    if (state.screen === 'attract') content += '<div class=\"center-copy\">DEMONSTRATION &nbsp; · &nbsp; PRESS ANY KEY</div>';\n  } else if (state.screen === 'slots') {\n    heading = 'YOUR STAY';\n    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; THE GUEST BOOK</div><h1>Make yourself at home.</h1><p>Choose a room for your island stay.</p></div></div><div class=\"card-grid\">${state.slots.map((slot, index) => `<button class=\"card slot-card\" data-action=\"slot\" data-id=\"${index}\"><span class=\"slot-num\">0${index + 1}</span><span class=\"slot-avatar\">${slot ? '☺' : '+'}</span><strong>${slot ? escapeHTML(slot.name) : 'New member'}</strong><small>${slot ? `${slot.finished ? 'Free practice' : `Day ${slot.day}`} · ${Math.floor(slot.minutes || 0)} fit minutes` : 'A fresh start awaits'}</small><span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', 'home')}</div></main>`;\n  } else if (state.screen === 'setup') {\n    heading = 'NEW MEMBER';\n84:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; NICE TO MEET YOU</div><h1>A little about you.</h1><p>There is no wrong way to arrive.</p></div></div><div class=\"card setup-card\"><label class=\"field\">WHAT SHOULD WE CALL YOU?<input id=\"nickname\" maxlength=\"16\" value=\"${escapeHTML(member.name === 'Guest' ? '' : member.name)}\" placeholder=\"Your name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label><p class=\"field-label\">CHOOSE YOUR COLOUR</p><div class=\"options\">${OUTFITS.map((color, index) => `<button class=\"option swatch ${member.outfit === index ? 'selected' : ''}\" data-action=\"outfit\" data-id=\"${index}\" style=\"--swatch:${color}\" aria-label=\"Outfit ${index + 1}\">${member.outfit === index ? '✓' : ''}</button>`).join('')}</div><p class=\"field-label\">YOUR INSTRUCTOR</p><div class=\"options\">${['Birch', 'Alder'].map(name => `<button class=\"option ${member.instructor === name ? 'selected' : ''}\" data-action=\"instructor\" data-id=\"${name}\">${name === 'Birch' ? '✳' : '✦'} &nbsp; ${name}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', 'slots')}${button('Arrive on the island', 'create-member', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n123:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; BETTER TOGETHER</div><h1>Make room for friends.</h1><p>Up to four share the same screen. One keyboard player; connect controllers for more.</p></div></div><div class=\"class-players\">${[0, 1, 2, 3].map((index) => `<div class=\"card player-tile\"><span class=\"slot-avatar\">${players[index] ? '☺' : '+'}</span><strong>${players[index] ? escapeHTML(players[index].name) : 'Open spot'}</strong><small>${players[index] ? escapeHTML(players[index].type) : 'Join or add a bot'}</small><button class=\"chip\" data-action=\"class-toggle\" data-id=\"${index}\">${players[index] ? 'REMOVE' : 'ADD BOT'}</button></div>`).join('')}</div><div class=\"card class-select\"><p>CHOOSE A CLASS</p><div class=\"options\">${['stork','candle','step','slalom','tray'].map(id => `<button class=\"option ${state.selection?.id === id ? 'selected' : ''}\" data-action=\"class-activity\" data-id=\"${id}\">${ACTIVITIES.find(a => a.id === id).name}</button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class=\"actions\">${button('Back', member.name === 'Guest' ? 'home' : 'island')}${button('Start class', 'start-class', true)}</div></main>`;\n129:    content = `<main class=\"main-wrap narrow\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">✳ &nbsp; MAKE YOURSELF COMFORTABLE</div><h1>Your settings.</h1></div></div><div class=\"card settings-card\">${settingRow('Music', state.settings.music + '%', 'volume', 'music')}${settingRow('Sound effects', state.settings.sound + '%', 'volume', 'sound')}${settingRow('Voice sounds', state.settings.voice ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'voice')}${settingRow('Gentle mode', state.settings.gentle ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'gentle')}${settingRow('Breathing', state.settings.breathToggle ? 'TOGGLE' : 'HOLD', 'toggle', 'breathToggle')}${settingRow('Tips', state.settings.tips ? 'ON' : 'OFF', 'toggle', 'tips')}${settingRow('Controller symbols', state.settings.glyphs.toUpperCase(), 'glyphs')}<p class=\"note\">Select a volume to cycle from 0% to 100%. Gentle mode makes balancing more forgiving.</p><div class=\"actions\">${button('Done', 'settings-back', true)}</div></div></main>`;\n293:    case 'settings-back': save(); screen(state.returnScreen || 'title'); break;\n319:  if (state.screen === 'hub' && !state.hub.started && !state.hub.finished && key === 'enter') { event.preventDefault(); action(document.activeElement?.dataset.action === 'hub-more' ? 'hub-more' : 'hub-ready'); return; }\n320:  if (key === 'escape' || key === 'backspace') { if (state.screen === 'settings') action('settings-back'); else if (state.screen === 'pause') action('resume'); else if (state.screen === 'about') action('about-back'); else if (state.screen === 'dev') screen('pause'); else if (state.screen === 'activity') action('island'); else if (state.screen === 'slots' || state.screen === 'class') action('home'); return; }\n348:        else if (index === 1) { if (state.screen === 'settings') action('settings-back'); else if (state.screen === 'pause') action('resume'); else if (state.screen === 'about') action('about-back'); else if (!state.hub.active) action('home'); }\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-3d2dge-handoff\",\n  \"version\": \"0.89.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"description\": \"my-3D2dge for coding agents: the engine, its card, index and guide, the tools and a template game\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"node game/test.mjs\",\n    \"check\": \"node tools/check.mjs game/index.html\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"playwright\": \"1.63.0\"\n  }\n}\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/package.json:3:  \"version\": \"0.89.0\",\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:2: * my-3D2dge v0.89.0  (My \"3D\" 2D Game Engine)\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:83:const E = { version: '0.89.0', build: 'dev-build', name: 'my-3D2dge', TAU, DEG, current: null };\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:10609:my-3D2dge module ARCADE v0.89.0: the coin-op's frame: scores, high-score tables and initials, lives, credits, turns, cards, the attract mode\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:10824:my-3D2dge module CLICK v0.89.0: point-and-click adventures: walk areas with holes, depth, hotspots, verbs, an inventory\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:11184:my-3D2dge module DRIVE v0.89.0: cars on the ground plane, a race round a track, the drivers who race it\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:11410:my-3D2dge module FIGHT v0.89.0: one-on-one fighting: fighters with frame data, guards, throws, specials, a meter; rounds; a CPU; training\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:11961:my-3D2dge module GEN v0.89.0: generated maps: rooms and corridors, BSP, caves, mazes and scatter, from a seed\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:12144:my-3D2dge module GRID v0.89.0: square and hex grids: paths, ranges, lines, fields of view, fog, groups, movers and turns\nWee Bit of Zen-Wii Fit-gpt-6.1-terra-max-20261104-221356/engine/my-3d2dge.js:12553:my-3D2dge module MODE7 v0.89.0: a perspective floor drawn a row at a time, a sky that turns with it, everything on it scaled by its distance\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
